(352865, 27583, 806, '<td valign="top">The blunt response from me is: The HM has gotta go! LOL :)<br/>a slight angle of the body to the camera would be nicer. straight on has little appeal. The lighting is fair, and the skin tones could be less green and grainy.<br/>It is an interesting subject because of his physique. Perhaps that could have been enhanced with more creative lighting?<br/>good luck, and have fun!</td>', 'The blunt response from me is: The HM has gotta go! LOL :)a slight angle of the body to the camera would be nicer. straight on has little appeal. The lighting is fair, and the skin tones could be less green and grainy.It is an interesting subject because of his physique. Perhaps that could have been enhanced with more creative lighting?good luck, and have fun!', '2003-07-11 01:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(352867, 28227, 806, '<td valign="top">this seems to be a strange pose. unnatural and uncomfortable looking. Nice skin tones, and lighting to show detail.</td>', 'this seems to be a strange pose. unnatural and uncomfortable looking. Nice skin tones, and lighting to show detail.', '2003-07-11 01:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(352868, 27719, 6388, '<td valign="top">focus could be sharper - lighting is nice - baby is adorable.  Mom''s wrinkled nose makes the picture.</td>', 'focus could be sharper - lighting is nice - baby is adorable.  Mom''s wrinkled nose makes the picture.', '2003-07-11 01:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(352872, 27775, 6388, '<td valign="top">that''s hilarious. I don''t wanna know how you came up with the idea, but it''s brilliant.  Hard to give a serious critique, but the contrast could be a bit higher and the front of the boo---mountain is a little soft.  soft FOCUS I mean.  :)</td>', 'that''s hilarious. I don''t wanna know how you came up with the idea, but it''s brilliant.  Hard to give a serious critique, but the contrast could be a bit higher and the front of the boo---mountain is a little soft.  soft FOCUS I mean.  :)', '2003-07-11 01:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(352874, 27583, 5391, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of symmetry, very nice lighting that really brings out the human form.  It looks like the grain is intentional, but I''m not sure that it adds to the image for me as a viewer, personally.</td>', 'Interesting use of symmetry, very nice lighting that really brings out the human form.  It looks like the grain is intentional, but I''m not sure that it adds to the image for me as a viewer, personally.', '2003-07-11 01:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(352875, 28017, 6388, '<td valign="top">the lighting is a little off, and the pose looks quite un-natural (maybe that''s what you were going for).  I think you either shadow the face or don''t - just the arm shadow messes the perspective up a bit.<br/> <br/>**edit: still not even close to the best you''ve done of this subject (no offense intended).  Now that I know it''s yours I''m taking more time with it, and I still don''t like the way that shadow draws a line on his face.  The focus is a little soft...intentional to hide some skin imperfections?  If I didn''t know it was you, I would think some of these things were accidents...but I know your work better than that.  As it happens I just don''t agree with some of the choices.<br/> <br/>P<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-07-21 21:44:54.</i></td>', 'the lighting is a little off, and the pose looks quite un-natural (maybe that''s what you were going for).  I think you either shadow the face or don''t - just the arm shadow messes the perspective up a bit. **edit: still not even close to the best you''ve done of this subject (no offense intended).  Now that I know it''s yours I''m taking more time with it, and I still don''t like the way that shadow draws a line on his face.  The focus is a little soft...intentional to hide some skin imperfections?  If I didn''t know it was you, I would think some of these things were accidents...but I know your work better than that.  As it happens I just don''t agree with some of the choices. P', '2003-07-11 01:34:21.000000', '2003-07-21 22:44:54.000000', 1),
(352878, 28283, 6388, '<td valign="top">very sexy.  love what you did with the border, even though many will chastise you for it.  I think it''s very appropriate.  lighting is a little strong on the left, so it throws the balance off a bit.  I like it.</td>', 'very sexy.  love what you did with the border, even though many will chastise you for it.  I think it''s very appropriate.  lighting is a little strong on the left, so it throws the balance off a bit.  I like it.', '2003-07-11 01:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(352880, 28223, 6388, '<td valign="top">like the high-key lighting and composition.  the art leaves me wanting - more colour saturation or less.  it''s hard to tell if it''s there or not.  I''ll look again later on a brighter monitor and see if my opinion changes. 7</td>', 'like the high-key lighting and composition.  the art leaves me wanting - more colour saturation or less.  it''s hard to tell if it''s there or not.  I''ll look again later on a brighter monitor and see if my opinion changes. 7', '2003-07-11 01:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(352884, 28078, 3612, '<td valign="top">this is too weird... the woman on top looks just like me! love the post shot adjustments, they really add to the mood of the photo. - 8</td>', 'this is too weird... the woman on top looks just like me! love the post shot adjustments, they really add to the mood of the photo. - 8', '2003-07-11 01:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(352885, 28183, 6900, '<td valign="top">Would''ve been better in b/w.</td>', 'Would''ve been better in b/w.', '2003-07-11 01:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(352887, 28183, 7711, '<td valign="top">I think this would be an awesome shot if in black and white or some form of duotone, the skintone seems too red, and the whole shot seems stark because of it. I really like the post of your model, there is a lot of impact in his pose and expression. :)</td>', 'I think this would be an awesome shot if in black and white or some form of duotone, the skintone seems too red, and the whole shot seems stark because of it. I really like the post of your model, there is a lot of impact in his pose and expression. :)', '2003-07-11 01:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(352889, 27974, 2612, '<td valign="top">One of the twop two in the challenge (from my perspective). I like the strong diagonal and the complexity of the shadows. The highights on her body seem to draw you attention right to the mask . Very nice.</td>', 'One of the twop two in the challenge (from my perspective). I like the strong diagonal and the complexity of the shadows. The highights on her body seem to draw you attention right to the mask . Very nice.', '2003-07-11 01:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(352890, 28260, 7711, '<td valign="top">without the sunglasses, this could almost remind me of renaissance art with very curve models who were not stick thin, however, I think there are too many mixed genres going on in this shot to clearly give off one message.</td>', 'without the sunglasses, this could almost remind me of renaissance art with very curve models who were not stick thin, however, I think there are too many mixed genres going on in this shot to clearly give off one message.', '2003-07-11 01:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(352891, 28074, 2279, '<td valign="top">Looks to me like you did some dodging and burning around the kid. Looks like she seems to be glowing which actually might have been your reasoning behind it.</td>', 'Looks to me like you did some dodging and burning around the kid. Looks like she seems to be glowing which actually might have been your reasoning behind it.', '2003-07-11 01:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
