(353007, 28227, 6349, '<td valign="top">IMO the hand placement ruins this shot, although perhaps that was just what you were going for, trying to portray primitive man (or woman) scratching themselves.  I like the composition and lighting a lot though.  The leg up on the rock looks a bit awkward too.</td>', 'IMO the hand placement ruins this shot, although perhaps that was just what you were going for, trying to portray primitive man (or woman) scratching themselves.  I like the composition and lighting a lot though.  The leg up on the rock looks a bit awkward too.', '2003-07-11 03:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(353008, 28271, 4564, '<td valign="top">I see what you tried to do here. Unfortunately, it seems to me that lighting could have played a better role in this picture.  As it is, it is more on the dull side visually.  Also, I feel the image would have worked a lot better if you had moved the camera to the right so the curve line created by the skin and black bgr could almost touch the left corner of your image. It might have been a better composition... Worth trying.</td>', 'I see what you tried to do here. Unfortunately, it seems to me that lighting could have played a better role in this picture.  As it is, it is more on the dull side visually.  Also, I feel the image would have worked a lot better if you had moved the camera to the right so the curve line created by the skin and black bgr could almost touch the left corner of your image. It might have been a better composition... Worth trying.', '2003-07-11 03:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(353011, 28229, 4564, '<td valign="top">Fantastic use of single light source, adding strong focus on the eye.  Lovely composition.  Unfortunately, I don''t feel this image fits in the nude challenge...  Nice effort though. 5</td>', 'Fantastic use of single light source, adding strong focus on the eye.  Lovely composition.  Unfortunately, I don''t feel this image fits in the nude challenge...  Nice effort though. 5', '2003-07-11 03:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
