(353022, 27336, 6349, '<td valign="top">the photoshop technique is too obvious here IMO, although I like the idea of the shot quite a lot and it is a fine example of the filter that you used.</td>', 'the photoshop technique is too obvious here IMO, although I like the idea of the shot quite a lot and it is a fine example of the filter that you used.', '2003-07-11 03:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(353024, 28254, 4564, '<td valign="top">Lighting is crucial in this kind of photo in order to convey a sense of how you want your viewer to look at the image.  As it is, it look more like a technical medical reference shot.  Try experimenting with the light source, changing the angles of the light source.  5</td>', 'Lighting is crucial in this kind of photo in order to convey a sense of how you want your viewer to look at the image.  As it is, it look more like a technical medical reference shot.  Try experimenting with the light source, changing the angles of the light source.  5', '2003-07-11 03:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(353025, 27751, 6349, '<td valign="top">Good shadow work.  This is good for black on black, but i would have liked a little bit more light in the highlights.  As it is, the ring really draws considerable attention (which may have been you''re desire, esp. if she''s you or yours) but I think it is destracting.  Really nice shot though!</td>', 'Good shadow work.  This is good for black on black, but i would have liked a little bit more light in the highlights.  As it is, the ring really draws considerable attention (which may have been you''re desire, esp. if she''s you or yours) but I think it is destracting.  Really nice shot though!', '2003-07-11 03:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(353027, 28222, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Do women really often grabs their own breasts when they''re naked and not posing for pictures?  I always wondered that.  In my expereince it isn''t the case.  Still, this looks natural enough, if a little posed.  The shade of the duotone may be a little off for a sunbathing situation, but I''m not sure what would improve it.  Nice work.  One of the best so far!</td>', 'I like this.  Do women really often grabs their own breasts when they''re naked and not posing for pictures?  I always wondered that.  In my expereince it isn''t the case.  Still, this looks natural enough, if a little posed.  The shade of the duotone may be a little off for a sunbathing situation, but I''m not sure what would improve it.  Nice work.  One of the best so far!', '2003-07-11 03:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(353028, 28274, 6349, '<td valign="top">Cool lighitng.  Is it from a window?</td>', 'Cool lighitng.  Is it from a window?', '2003-07-11 03:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(353029, 28058, 4564, '<td valign="top">Wow, a beautiful pregnant woman.  I so hoped to see one of these in this challenge!  And it''s tough to find a pregnant woman to pose!  And if this is your wife, congratulations to the both of you for the wonderful thing happening to you.  About the photo itself: very good choice of color.  Excellent softness in the photo (I suspect a diffuse glow in photoshop).  Nice lighting on the belly and breast.  Nice dark area on the left.  The thing that doesn''t for me with this photo is the straight shot and composition.  I feel this photo, as it is, would have worked a lot better by cropping a lot closer to the body and putting emphasis on the belly, breast, hair and the leg at the bottom right.  Or perhaps just cropping some of the left area of the photo.  It''s a nice photo, but it''s missing that "something" to make it great.  Very nice try though! 6</td>', 'Wow, a beautiful pregnant woman.  I so hoped to see one of these in this challenge!  And it''s tough to find a pregnant woman to pose!  And if this is your wife, congratulations to the both of you for the wonderful thing happening to you.  About the photo itself: very good choice of color.  Excellent softness in the photo (I suspect a diffuse glow in photoshop).  Nice lighting on the belly and breast.  Nice dark area on the left.  The thing that doesn''t for me with this photo is the straight shot and composition.  I feel this photo, as it is, would have worked a lot better by cropping a lot closer to the body and putting emphasis on the belly, breast, hair and the leg at the bottom right.  Or perhaps just cropping some of the left area of the photo.  It''s a nice photo, but it''s missing that "something" to make it great.  Very nice try though! 6', '2003-07-11 03:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(353030, 28191, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like the compositing you''ve done here.  I almost submitted something similar but didn''t because I''m a guy and guy''s figures don''t make nearly as good of an image!  Cheers!  Nice work.</td>', 'I like the compositing you''ve done here.  I almost submitted something similar but didn''t because I''m a guy and guy''s figures don''t make nearly as good of an image!  Cheers!  Nice work.', '2003-07-11 03:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
