(353042, 27589, 4564, '<td valign="top">I''ll tell you what: this show is absolutely lovely!  And I feel so sad that you felt the need to add an old canvas texture with photoshop.  The colors and composition are so lovely in themselves, I strongly feel that the added texture distracts from this lovely shot, especially in the dark areas such as the lower right end on the leg and hips.  7.   (this photo could do without the current border.  The colors of the border don''t match at all with the photo. Perhaps no border, or a simple balck border would have worked better).</td>', 'I''ll tell you what: this show is absolutely lovely!  And I feel so sad that you felt the need to add an old canvas texture with photoshop.  The colors and composition are so lovely in themselves, I strongly feel that the added texture distracts from this lovely shot, especially in the dark areas such as the lower right end on the leg and hips.  7.   (this photo could do without the current border.  The colors of the border don''t match at all with the photo. Perhaps no border, or a simple balck border would have worked better).', '2003-07-11 03:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
