(353051, 28078, 4564, '<td valign="top">Daring! I love it! I had a good feeling about the nude challenge, but I never thought some would be as daring and I like that!  I think yuo captured a very nice moment here.  The expressions on the faces (even if we don''t see the man''s face very well) are very tender and sweet.  I feel this image could use less contrast.  As it is, it feels like it''s been retouched a lot more than it needed in photoshop.  More details in the hair would have brought up this photo to a new level.  As it is, I give it a 7.  Good job.</td>', 'Daring! I love it! I had a good feeling about the nude challenge, but I never thought some would be as daring and I like that!  I think yuo captured a very nice moment here.  The expressions on the faces (even if we don''t see the man''s face very well) are very tender and sweet.  I feel this image could use less contrast.  As it is, it feels like it''s been retouched a lot more than it needed in photoshop.  More details in the hair would have brought up this photo to a new level.  As it is, I give it a 7.  Good job.', '2003-07-11 03:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(353053, 27775, 4564, '<td valign="top">Superb!  Lovely!  This is so absurd, I love it!  The composition is great and the montage very good.  The thing missing from this picture is lighting.  It could use a better light source, maybe trying to simulate the sun- something harder and warmer.  It would bring this photo to a new level.  7</td>', 'Superb!  Lovely!  This is so absurd, I love it!  The composition is great and the montage very good.  The thing missing from this picture is lighting.  It could use a better light source, maybe trying to simulate the sun- something harder and warmer.  It would bring this photo to a new level.  7', '2003-07-11 03:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(353057, 27571, 4564, '<td valign="top">Gorgous.  I love it. (well of course, anything in this style I have a strong feeling about- look at my portfolio to see why.).  Excellent composition. Lovely skin color.  Very soft lighting- it works!  This photo is only missing a bit more detail on the legs so we could see just a bit more the lace at the top of the stocking.  It would have helped.  Very well done though! 8</td>', 'Gorgous.  I love it. (well of course, anything in this style I have a strong feeling about- look at my portfolio to see why.).  Excellent composition. Lovely skin color.  Very soft lighting- it works!  This photo is only missing a bit more detail on the legs so we could see just a bit more the lace at the top of the stocking.  It would have helped.  Very well done though! 8', '2003-07-11 03:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(353059, 27790, 4564, '<td valign="top">The composition is what makes this photo strong visually.  It works.  The use of the semi-see through glass is a nice idea.  The brownish color nehind the glass at the bottom distracts me from the beauty of this shot.  Overall, well done! 7</td>', 'The composition is what makes this photo strong visually.  It works.  The use of the semi-see through glass is a nice idea.  The brownish color nehind the glass at the bottom distracts me from the beauty of this shot.  Overall, well done! 7', '2003-07-11 03:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
