(353126, 28192, 6388, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot that I love about this. The pose is fantastic; unique in this challenge for sure.  The desaturation works well, and really fits nicely with the border (don''t listen to all the jokers who will tell you they don''t like your border - it''s great).  Can just see enough of her (your?) face to get an expression, which is very peaceful.<br/>I struggle with the editing.  the shadow is unnatural, and the cutout is a little choppy in parts (which is natural for cutouts - they''re very difficult to pull off).  After 40 votes or so, this is my favourite.</td>', 'There''s a lot that I love about this. The pose is fantastic; unique in this challenge for sure.  The desaturation works well, and really fits nicely with the border (don''t listen to all the jokers who will tell you they don''t like your border - it''s great).  Can just see enough of her (your?) face to get an expression, which is very peaceful.I struggle with the editing.  the shadow is unnatural, and the cutout is a little choppy in parts (which is natural for cutouts - they''re very difficult to pull off).  After 40 votes or so, this is my favourite.', '2003-07-11 04:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
