(353129, 27563, 6388, '<td valign="top">I assume it''s an edit...maybe not.  good enough to fool most if it is.  Other than that the pic doesn''t do much for me.  A fill flash would help some of the shadows (the shadows don''t add much to the composition if they were intentional), and I might incread the depth to blur the background a bit.</td>', 'I assume it''s an edit...maybe not.  good enough to fool most if it is.  Other than that the pic doesn''t do much for me.  A fill flash would help some of the shadows (the shadows don''t add much to the composition if they were intentional), and I might incread the depth to blur the background a bit.', '2003-07-11 04:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
