(353440, 28271, 7293, '<td valign="top">I think the red color helped this shot quite a bit.</td>', 'I think the red color helped this shot quite a bit.', '2003-07-11 10:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(353442, 28282, 7293, '<td valign="top">Thought at first I didn''t like this, and actually, as an interpretation of the theme, I don''t. As a composition though, I do. I like the drops of water and the way the face occupies one corner while the faucet is in the other.</td>', 'Thought at first I didn''t like this, and actually, as an interpretation of the theme, I don''t. As a composition though, I do. I like the drops of water and the way the face occupies one corner while the faucet is in the other.', '2003-07-11 10:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(353443, 28116, 7293, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more highlights on the hair, considering the extreme white area to the right of the model.</td>', 'I would have liked to see more highlights on the hair, considering the extreme white area to the right of the model.', '2003-07-11 10:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(353444, 28260, 7293, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more of the arms.</td>', 'I would like to see more of the arms.', '2003-07-11 10:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(353447, 28219, 7293, '<td valign="top">Cannot figure out what''s going on with the hands in the lower part of the picture! What in the world... ? I think I might like it better if the main model had both hands behind the back, letting the long-nailed hands be the only two visible. The concept of this is interesting though!</td>', 'Cannot figure out what''s going on with the hands in the lower part of the picture! What in the world... ? I think I might like it better if the main model had both hands behind the back, letting the long-nailed hands be the only two visible. The concept of this is interesting though!', '2003-07-11 10:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(353448, 28087, 7293, '<td valign="top">Something about that left buttock makes this look very unnatural. I like the expression on the car driver''s face though!</td>', 'Something about that left buttock makes this look very unnatural. I like the expression on the car driver''s face though!', '2003-07-11 10:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(353450, 27841, 7293, '<td valign="top">Wow! I love the concept of the shadows... er, tattoos continuing across the two bodies here. Excellent and the best in this contest IMHO.  Crossing my fingers for a ribbon on this one.</td>', 'Wow! I love the concept of the shadows... er, tattoos continuing across the two bodies here. Excellent and the best in this contest IMHO.  Crossing my fingers for a ribbon on this one.', '2003-07-11 10:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(353452, 27583, 8610, '<td valign="top">Another HM project... hmmm silly :D<br/>Nice pic though -7</td>', 'Another HM project... hmmm silly :DNice pic though -7', '2003-07-11 10:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(353453, 28074, 7293, '<td valign="top">The footprints and shadows add interest to what I might otherwise have considered a slight cop-out (using a child model). I might have liked to see a bit of her other leg if possible.</td>', 'The footprints and shadows add interest to what I might otherwise have considered a slight cop-out (using a child model). I might have liked to see a bit of her other leg if possible.', '2003-07-11 10:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(353455, 28286, 7293, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. I might have liked to see a conductor''s baton or something, but really, your posture gets it across well enough.</td>', 'I like the concept. I might have liked to see a conductor''s baton or something, but really, your posture gets it across well enough.', '2003-07-11 10:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(353456, 27976, 7293, '<td valign="top">Nice shadows on the sheets, pretty good composition and you actually got the baby to smile! I do consider this interpretation of the theme to be a bit of a cop-out, but that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'Nice shadows on the sheets, pretty good composition and you actually got the baby to smile! I do consider this interpretation of the theme to be a bit of a cop-out, but that''s just my opinion.', '2003-07-11 10:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(353460, 28191, 7293, '<td valign="top">A bit on the abstract side. Nice! I don''t like it, though, that the buttocks part of the model is so much clearer than the upper body that attention is really drawn there. I''d like to be at least as interested in the hair and upper back area, but with the lack of definition there, I just can''t be.</td>', 'A bit on the abstract side. Nice! I don''t like it, though, that the buttocks part of the model is so much clearer than the upper body that attention is really drawn there. I''d like to be at least as interested in the hair and upper back area, but with the lack of definition there, I just can''t be.', '2003-07-11 10:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(353461, 28090, 8610, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. Good Luck - 7</td>', 'Clever idea. Good Luck - 7', '2003-07-11 10:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(353463, 28297, 7293, '<td valign="top">It''s very nice to see an action shot in the middle of all the oh-so-serious b&amp;w bodyscapes. :)  I would have liked to see the other foot though. That''s my only real complaint.</td>', 'It''s very nice to see an action shot in the middle of all the oh-so-serious b&w bodyscapes. :)  I would have liked to see the other foot though. That''s my only real complaint.', '2003-07-11 10:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(353465, 28231, 7293, '<td valign="top">Love the setting and title. I wish I''d been able to get outside for this one!</td>', 'Love the setting and title. I wish I''d been able to get outside for this one!', '2003-07-11 10:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(353466, 28078, 7293, '<td valign="top">I like the bright red at the bottom of the shot contrasting with the black area. I might have liked this to be cropped a bit from the top though... there''s a LOT of pure black. It also looks a bit strange that the part in the woman''s hair is the brightest spot in the picture! Spot editing that might have been nice.</td>', 'I like the bright red at the bottom of the shot contrasting with the black area. I might have liked this to be cropped a bit from the top though... there''s a LOT of pure black. It also looks a bit strange that the part in the woman''s hair is the brightest spot in the picture! Spot editing that might have been nice.', '2003-07-11 10:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(353467, 28222, 7293, '<td valign="top">She looks happy. :)</td>', 'She looks happy. :)', '2003-07-11 10:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(353469, 28005, 7293, '<td valign="top">I like the very light tone of this. It does create a certain softness that works well here. I would like to see less tension in the right leg--weird thing to pick on maybe, but she''d look much more relaxed if more of the ball of the foot, at least, were on the ground.  Destined for a ribbon? :)</td>', 'I like the very light tone of this. It does create a certain softness that works well here. I would like to see less tension in the right leg--weird thing to pick on maybe, but she''d look much more relaxed if more of the ball of the foot, at least, were on the ground.  Destined for a ribbon? :)', '2003-07-11 10:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(353471, 28193, 7293, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like shots with extreme foreshortening along a person''s length, but you make it work pretty well. Nice composition.</td>', 'I don''t usually like shots with extreme foreshortening along a person''s length, but you make it work pretty well. Nice composition.', '2003-07-11 10:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(353472, 27751, 7293, '<td valign="top">The shadow thrown on the background is distracting... other than that, it''s a good pose for this model.</td>', 'The shadow thrown on the background is distracting... other than that, it''s a good pose for this model.', '2003-07-11 10:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(353474, 27775, 7293, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s original anyway!  :) I would have liked to see just the goat without the rock, if possible... but if it wouldn''t stay, I see why you''d choose not to resort to superglue.</td>', 'Well, it''s original anyway!  :) I would have liked to see just the goat without the rock, if possible... but if it wouldn''t stay, I see why you''d choose not to resort to superglue.', '2003-07-11 10:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(353475, 28227, 7293, '<td valign="top">I might have liked the model''s right hand to be flat on her buttocks instead of it looking like she''s about to scratch--otherwise this shot is just about perfect. Very nice that you were able to get outside for this one!</td>', 'I might have liked the model''s right hand to be flat on her buttocks instead of it looking like she''s about to scratch--otherwise this shot is just about perfect. Very nice that you were able to get outside for this one!', '2003-07-11 10:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(353479, 28052, 7293, '<td valign="top">Cute... a cop-out, but cute.</td>', 'Cute... a cop-out, but cute.', '2003-07-11 10:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(353480, 28219, 9833, '<td valign="top">Very Creative. Great picture !</td>', 'Very Creative. Great picture !', '2003-07-11 10:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(353481, 28116, 9833, '<td valign="top">I love the idea. Leaves a lot to wonder. Very nice.</td>', 'I love the idea. Leaves a lot to wonder. Very nice.', '2003-07-11 10:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(353482, 27336, 7293, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but why does the water look so glutinous? I might have liked a shot that didn''t show the green shower wall, but more of the model in the water. Good, original idea, though.</td>', 'I like the concept, but why does the water look so glutinous? I might have liked a shot that didn''t show the green shower wall, but more of the model in the water. Good, original idea, though.', '2003-07-11 10:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(353484, 27589, 7293, '<td valign="top">I like the filter you used, and I''d like the rest if this were for another challenge. No offense, but it''s not very nude, you know?</td>', 'I like the filter you used, and I''d like the rest if this were for another challenge. No offense, but it''s not very nude, you know?', '2003-07-11 11:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(353485, 27571, 9833, '<td valign="top">I love the color in this shot. Very creative. How you just left a little to see was brilliant !</td>', 'I love the color in this shot. Very creative. How you just left a little to see was brilliant !', '2003-07-11 11:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(353487, 28078, 9833, '<td valign="top">Beautiful coloring. I like the emotion in this shot too.</td>', 'Beautiful coloring. I like the emotion in this shot too.', '2003-07-11 11:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(353494, 28223, 3087, '<td valign="top">First thing that strikes me is the strong composition. I like the shapes formed by her crooked arm, body and the frame of the image. I like the way the main triangle of negative space is echoed by the triangular tattoo. I also like the way her hair merges into the darkness at the top right.<br/>That said, I''m not sure about how much this says "nude" to me - given that one often sees this much skin just walking down the highstreet at this time of year (especially given current UK temperatures). If I could vote I wouldn''t score down for that, it''s just my impression, but I would say that this wouldn''t strike me as "nude" if I saw it on another site, in another challenge.<br/>Lastly, darkness: A tutor used to tell me, as I tried to work out whether I''d used a suitable exposure and contrast grade in the darkroom, to think about the white and black in the original scene I was portraying. If there were white highlights in the original then I should see some white in my print. If there were solid black areas in the original scene, I should see those in the print also. This is assuming I the scene was lit as I intended and I had successfully captured that on my negative. In this image, I assume I''m looking at a caucasian model, yet her skin seems rather grey to me. That said, maybe she has a slight tan or a darker natural skintone? Personally I''d prefer this to be a touch lighter over her arm and hand and shoulder blade areas, though it''s about right at her neck.<br/>Sorry for rambling...<br/>:D</td>', 'First thing that strikes me is the strong composition. I like the shapes formed by her crooked arm, body and the frame of the image. I like the way the main triangle of negative space is echoed by the triangular tattoo. I also like the way her hair merges into the darkness at the top right.That said, I''m not sure about how much this says "nude" to me - given that one often sees this much skin just walking down the highstreet at this time of year (especially given current UK temperatures). If I could vote I wouldn''t score down for that, it''s just my impression, but I would say that this wouldn''t strike me as "nude" if I saw it on another site, in another challenge.Lastly, darkness: A tutor used to tell me, as I tried to work out whether I''d used a suitable exposure and contrast grade in the darkroom, to think about the white and black in the original scene I was portraying. If there were white highlights in the original then I should see some white in my print. If there were solid black areas in the original scene, I should see those in the print also. This is assuming I the scene was lit as I intended and I had successfully captured that on my negative. In this image, I assume I''m looking at a caucasian model, yet her skin seems rather grey to me. That said, maybe she has a slight tan or a darker natural skintone? Personally I''d prefer this to be a touch lighter over her arm and hand and shoulder blade areas, though it''s about right at her neck.Sorry for rambling...:D', '2003-07-11 11:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(353497, 28005, 4338, '<td valign="top">lighting and composition are great</td>', 'lighting and composition are great', '2003-07-11 11:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(353499, 27719, 4338, '<td valign="top">i feel a different angle and different lighting would have made a stronger image</td>', 'i feel a different angle and different lighting would have made a stronger image', '2003-07-11 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(353502, 28074, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not what one would think of for a nude but an excellent one, nonetheless!<br/>I love the composition of this - that diagonal leading line of little wet footprints is both "darling" and compositionally/ graphically appealing. I also like the question it raises about where she is marching off to. Her wonderful pose makes for an interesting shadow shape too.<br/>Only minor point -ve point I''d make is that there seem to be some highlights that are a little blown out on her botton, shoulders and back of her legs, though I can see that the natural light was quite strong.<br/>I think this is a lovely lovely entry.</td>', 'Not what one would think of for a nude but an excellent one, nonetheless!I love the composition of this - that diagonal leading line of little wet footprints is both "darling" and compositionally/ graphically appealing. I also like the question it raises about where she is marching off to. Her wonderful pose makes for an interesting shadow shape too.Only minor point -ve point I''d make is that there seem to be some highlights that are a little blown out on her botton, shoulders and back of her legs, though I can see that the natural light was quite strong.I think this is a lovely lovely entry.', '2003-07-11 11:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(353503, 27841, 10100, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo!</td>', 'This is a great photo!', '2003-07-11 11:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(353504, 27775, 4258, '<td valign="top">Ha Ha! sure got my goat ;)</td>', 'Ha Ha! sure got my goat ;)', '2003-07-11 11:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(353505, 28248, 4338, '<td valign="top">very nice image, great job</td>', 'very nice image, great job', '2003-07-11 11:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(353506, 27841, 4258, '<td valign="top">I had hoped someone did projection tatoos - good one</td>', 'I had hoped someone did projection tatoos - good one', '2003-07-11 11:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(353507, 28248, 4258, '<td valign="top">Lovely - care to explain how this was done without photoshopping only a part of the image?</td>', 'Lovely - care to explain how this was done without photoshopping only a part of the image?', '2003-07-11 11:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(353510, 28074, 327, '<td valign="top">No matter if this shot wins here or not.........it is fantastic!!!!!!!! I think this is just a great shot. I like every aspect here....the light, the tones, the focus. The only small flaw or disruption--- is the line in the sidewalk at the top. It could be removed with ease. Wonderful work, very good. #1 for me.</td>', 'No matter if this shot wins here or not.........it is fantastic!!!!!!!! I think this is just a great shot. I like every aspect here....the light, the tones, the focus. The only small flaw or disruption--- is the line in the sidewalk at the top. It could be removed with ease. Wonderful work, very good. #1 for me.', '2003-07-11 11:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(353512, 28191, 327, '<td valign="top">Cleve, unique.</td>', 'Cleve, unique.', '2003-07-11 11:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(353514, 28231, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot content wise and composition wise. <br/>I particularly love the inclusion of the skyline.<br/>I love the ripple pattern near the model''s feet and the way they direct the eye to the horizon and light lines of waves or water near that. <br/>The horizon feels a little tilted to me - could perhaps do with a touch of rotation.<br/>The model is neither a silhouette nor well enough lit not to be a silhouette, sort of stuck somewhere in between. Therefore my main preference would be to have some fillin light directed towards his body. Not too much, so one still gets the impression of him standing to face the sun, but just a touch to show more detail.<br/></td>', 'I like this a lot content wise and composition wise. I particularly love the inclusion of the skyline.I love the ripple pattern near the model''s feet and the way they direct the eye to the horizon and light lines of waves or water near that. The horizon feels a little tilted to me - could perhaps do with a touch of rotation.The model is neither a silhouette nor well enough lit not to be a silhouette, sort of stuck somewhere in between. Therefore my main preference would be to have some fillin light directed towards his body. Not too much, so one still gets the impression of him standing to face the sun, but just a touch to show more detail.', '2003-07-11 11:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(353515, 28283, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute idea and well done. I like this very much. Crop is a bit tight at the bottom but I think you''ve done a nice job.</td>', 'Cute idea and well done. I like this very much. Crop is a bit tight at the bottom but I think you''ve done a nice job.', '2003-07-11 11:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(353516, 27790, 327, '<td valign="top">Well done. This has been done to death, but I think yours in color is good. The pose is super nice. Bravo.</td>', 'Well done. This has been done to death, but I think yours in color is good. The pose is super nice. Bravo.', '2003-07-11 11:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(353519, 28223, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat tat.</td>', 'Neat tat.', '2003-07-11 11:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(353520, 28260, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, with a couple of exceptions. Firstly, I''m definitely not keen on the sunglasses or the way the water ripples over her lower leg. It sort of cuts up into the flesh of her thigh too - so the shape and size of her thigh doesn''t feel quite right to me.<br/>Secondly I''d like just a touch more light on the foreground arm. Not too much, as I like that some parts of her just merge into the blackness, but a touch more would be my preference.<br/>I love the relaxed pose and the suntan shapes...</td>', 'I like this a lot, with a couple of exceptions. Firstly, I''m definitely not keen on the sunglasses or the way the water ripples over her lower leg. It sort of cuts up into the flesh of her thigh too - so the shape and size of her thigh doesn''t feel quite right to me.Secondly I''d like just a touch more light on the foreground arm. Not too much, as I like that some parts of her just merge into the blackness, but a touch more would be my preference.I love the relaxed pose and the suntan shapes...', '2003-07-11 11:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(353521, 28282, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool idea and composition. Bonus for the risk to your camera! lol<br/></td>', 'Pretty cool idea and composition. Bonus for the risk to your camera! lol', '2003-07-11 11:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(353524, 28274, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lovely example of really painting with light. I love the way the light defines her body like contour lines on a map. Is that an arm at the lower left or a fold of cloth? Either way I''m not sure about its position - I think arms above body and out of shot might be better. Also not sure about colour and contrast settings - seem to flatted it a little - though that''s perhaps what you intended?<br/>All in all an intriguing image.</td>', 'A lovely example of really painting with light. I love the way the light defines her body like contour lines on a map. Is that an arm at the lower left or a fold of cloth? Either way I''m not sure about its position - I think arms above body and out of shot might be better. Also not sure about colour and contrast settings - seem to flatted it a little - though that''s perhaps what you intended?All in all an intriguing image.', '2003-07-11 11:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(353525, 28017, 327, '<td valign="top">Yes, I see characteristics of both male and female......however the buns are all male. Neat idea, unusual.</td>', 'Yes, I see characteristics of both male and female......however the buns are all male. Neat idea, unusual.', '2003-07-11 11:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
