(353532, 28283, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very strong shapes in this - and excellent pose to protect modesty whilst still conveying "nude". <br/>I don''t like the way that the border is slimmer at the top - I would prefer it to be uniform width all around, even though that''s quite wide because of your decision to have the feet "fall out" of the border.</td>', 'Very strong shapes in this - and excellent pose to protect modesty whilst still conveying "nude". I don''t like the way that the border is slimmer at the top - I would prefer it to be uniform width all around, even though that''s quite wide because of your decision to have the feet "fall out" of the border.', '2003-07-11 11:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
