(353543, 28121, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this----not sure that makes me strange or not. LOL&gt; It just appeals to me.</td>', 'I like this----not sure that makes me strange or not. LOL> It just appeals to me.', '2003-07-11 11:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(353544, 28183, 3102, '<td valign="top">Hey, you went with the switch!  I like this a lot, or as least as much as I''ll admit as a hetrosexual male :)  My only gripe is that it looks like it''s tinted a bit on the blue-ish side.</td>', 'Hey, you went with the switch!  I like this a lot, or as least as much as I''ll admit as a hetrosexual male :)  My only gripe is that it looks like it''s tinted a bit on the blue-ish side.', '2003-07-11 11:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(353545, 28298, 327, '<td valign="top">Very very very nice lighting.</td>', 'Very very very nice lighting.', '2003-07-11 11:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(353547, 28281, 3599, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a little harsh, but maybe that is what you were going for considering this is an "evil" femme-bot.  The shadow from your flash is a bit distracting also.  Maybe using something to diffuse it would help prevent the shadows.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The lighting seems a little harsh, but maybe that is what you were going for considering this is an "evil" femme-bot.  The shadow from your flash is a bit distracting also.  Maybe using something to diffuse it would help prevent the shadows.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-07-11 11:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(353548, 28227, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great skin tones and setting!  My only complaint is that the top of her head gets a little lost in the background.  May have been a little stronger to have shot from a little higher angle to keep her head in front of the rocks.  - 8</td>', 'Great skin tones and setting!  My only complaint is that the top of her head gets a little lost in the background.  May have been a little stronger to have shot from a little higher angle to keep her head in front of the rocks.  - 8', '2003-07-11 11:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(353549, 28227, 3087, '<td valign="top">Firstly, I want to say how much I like the lighting in this - exposure seems just right.<br/>Please don''t take this the wrong way but the pose really looks very strange to me - lifting just one leg like that kind of makes me think of a pet going to the bathroom and the hand on the bottom doesn''t help dispel that. Truly, I''m not trying to be rude or offensive but to let you know honestly how the image strikes me.<br/>I think a similar pose with her sitting on flat rock, with both legs tucked to her right, bent to the same extent, would work much better.<br/>If this comment does upset you, please just drop me a PM and I will be happy to remove it ASAP.<br/>Kind Regards<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Firstly, I want to say how much I like the lighting in this - exposure seems just right.Please don''t take this the wrong way but the pose really looks very strange to me - lifting just one leg like that kind of makes me think of a pet going to the bathroom and the hand on the bottom doesn''t help dispel that. Truly, I''m not trying to be rude or offensive but to let you know honestly how the image strikes me.I think a similar pose with her sitting on flat rock, with both legs tucked to her right, bent to the same extent, would work much better.If this comment does upset you, please just drop me a PM and I will be happy to remove it ASAP.Kind RegardsKavey', '2003-07-11 11:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(353550, 28229, 327, '<td valign="top">Interesting, intriguing shot with a clever use of light. I don''t see a nude here. I think this is well done, but missed the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting, intriguing shot with a clever use of light. I don''t see a nude here. I think this is well done, but missed the challenge.', '2003-07-11 11:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(353551, 28222, 3102, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF and background.  The contrast is excellent to bring her out against it.  Oh, and the subject ain''t too shabby either :)  - 9</td>', 'Excellent DOF and background.  The contrast is excellent to bring her out against it.  Oh, and the subject ain''t too shabby either :)  - 9', '2003-07-11 11:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(353554, 27794, 3599, '<td valign="top">First impression is laughter.  I like the this shot and I have a smile on my face.  Good work and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'First impression is laughter.  I like the this shot and I have a smile on my face.  Good work and good luck in the challenge.', '2003-07-11 11:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(353556, 28282, 3087, '<td valign="top">A really interesting image - I like the reflections caught in the showerhead and the stop motion on the water. I also like the choice to go for high contrast in post processing. The crop (cutting out the eyes and rest of the head) works very well for me. I like the dark spaces too.</td>', 'A really interesting image - I like the reflections caught in the showerhead and the stop motion on the water. I also like the choice to go for high contrast in post processing. The crop (cutting out the eyes and rest of the head) works very well for me. I like the dark spaces too.', '2003-07-11 11:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(353558, 28229, 3599, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic lighting and composition.  Maybe the top of the head is a bit over-exposed.  Good work and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the dramatic lighting and composition.  Maybe the top of the head is a bit over-exposed.  Good work and good luck in the challenge.', '2003-07-11 11:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
