(353653, 27979, 6008, '<td valign="top">The image is interesting and it represents something that I''m familiar with, so it has more impact for me personally. I can see you likely went black and white to enchance the contrast between the boots/cuffs to the skin/background, and a lot of photographs in this genre seems to be black and white. It would be interesting to see color vs black and white, but I''m not sure there is enough contrast between the skintones and the background, esp as she is standing so close to it. Perhaps different lighting could enhance and emphasize a little more. The image is also somewhat blurry/soft, this is more pronounced with the hands. It''s visually appealing, but I think with a few adjustments it could have an even greater impact.</td>', 'The image is interesting and it represents something that I''m familiar with, so it has more impact for me personally. I can see you likely went black and white to enchance the contrast between the boots/cuffs to the skin/background, and a lot of photographs in this genre seems to be black and white. It would be interesting to see color vs black and white, but I''m not sure there is enough contrast between the skintones and the background, esp as she is standing so close to it. Perhaps different lighting could enhance and emphasize a little more. The image is also somewhat blurry/soft, this is more pronounced with the hands. It''s visually appealing, but I think with a few adjustments it could have an even greater impact.', '2003-07-11 12:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(353655, 27583, 5044, '<td valign="top">I like the grain effect on the torso. Shows good textures. Nice shadows, too.</td>', 'I like the grain effect on the torso. Shows good textures. Nice shadows, too.', '2003-07-11 12:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
