(353669, 28005, 4482, '<td valign="top">Snif snif.... is that the smell of victory????  :o)  Another great DrJOnes shot! You stayed simple, safe and classic so the DPCers will love it! If you don''t win I''ll be very surprised. Your model is even getting famous on DPC!!! ;o) <br/> <br/>IMHO the only 2 minor things I find distracting is the hand by the hat. It seems in movement and distracts from the "static" feeling of the shot. And I would''ve cropped a little closer to the foot to be symetrical with the hand... I don''t see the purpose of that negative space. But then again... VERY MINOR things my dear friend. :o) I would encourage you to do a whole high key theme.!! :o)</td>', 'Snif snif.... is that the smell of victory????  :o)  Another great DrJOnes shot! You stayed simple, safe and classic so the DPCers will love it! If you don''t win I''ll be very surprised. Your model is even getting famous on DPC!!! ;o)  IMHO the only 2 minor things I find distracting is the hand by the hat. It seems in movement and distracts from the "static" feeling of the shot. And I would''ve cropped a little closer to the foot to be symetrical with the hand... I don''t see the purpose of that negative space. But then again... VERY MINOR things my dear friend. :o) I would encourage you to do a whole high key theme.!! :o)', '2003-07-11 13:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
