(353916, 28090, 7628, '<td valign="top">Funny.  Wouldn''t work if not placed in a Nude Challenge, just a half decent pic of a fruit.  But I appreciate the break from human flesh.</td>', 'Funny.  Wouldn''t work if not placed in a Nude Challenge, just a half decent pic of a fruit.  But I appreciate the break from human flesh.', '2003-07-11 16:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
