(353930, 27336, 7628, '<td valign="top">cool effect!  Looks like she is in a sangria bath!  The banana is tring to be funny but I think it just distracts from a nice subject.    Really wonderful texture and reflections.</td>', 'cool effect!  Looks like she is in a sangria bath!  The banana is tring to be funny but I think it just distracts from a nice subject.    Really wonderful texture and reflections.', '2003-07-11 16:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
