(353940, 28052, 7628, '<td valign="top">O, I love kitties.  And I agree, this is as naked as a cat gets.  I have to admire how you captured the kritter''s interest to allow you time to take a nice cat photo - well lit and composed ( I like the tail swooping up to the right)</td>', 'O, I love kitties.  And I agree, this is as naked as a cat gets.  I have to admire how you captured the kritter''s interest to allow you time to take a nice cat photo - well lit and composed ( I like the tail swooping up to the right)', '2003-07-11 16:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(353941, 28222, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. The composition, DOF, textures, lighting  are all very well done. You have also captured a great expression in your model. One small thing, her hair seems to be tied up. Maybe letting it down would have added a little something more to the shot. Then again, maybe not. In my top 3......9</td>', 'Very nice photo. The composition, DOF, textures, lighting  are all very well done. You have also captured a great expression in your model. One small thing, her hair seems to be tied up. Maybe letting it down would have added a little something more to the shot. Then again, maybe not. In my top 3......9', '2003-07-11 16:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
