(353948, 28274, 9462, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like this one but the right arm kinda throws me off. I would''ve preferred to see no arms so as to accentuate the curve of her back.<br/>If I could vote I''d give it a 7.</td>', 'Nice, I like this one but the right arm kinda throws me off. I would''ve preferred to see no arms so as to accentuate the curve of her back.If I could vote I''d give it a 7.', '2003-07-11 17:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
