(354043, 28005, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very nice pose. I like the High-Key of this picture. Focus on the model is a little soft (for my liking) and you have some very pronounced JPEG artifatcs going on in the background. MAybe a little too much compression.  EDIT: ALL FIXED, switched to 32-bit. Thanks, Good luck! In my top 3</td>', 'Very nice pose. I like the High-Key of this picture. Focus on the model is a little soft (for my liking) and you have some very pronounced JPEG artifatcs going on in the background. MAybe a little too much compression.  EDIT: ALL FIXED, switched to 32-bit. Thanks, Good luck! In my top 3', '2003-07-11 18:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
