(354098, 27666, 6388, '<td valign="top">don''t love the crop, but I like the idea (I was the other one kinda like this).  I''d like a little more, or a little less...the hand at the bottom kind of appears out of nowhere.  lighting seems even, but a little flat, which i think comes from the background that happens to be the same shade of grey as your skin...a darker or light choice could have helped...nothing that couldn''t be fixed in photoshop this challenge.  good job.</td>', 'don''t love the crop, but I like the idea (I was the other one kinda like this).  I''d like a little more, or a little less...the hand at the bottom kind of appears out of nowhere.  lighting seems even, but a little flat, which i think comes from the background that happens to be the same shade of grey as your skin...a darker or light choice could have helped...nothing that couldn''t be fixed in photoshop this challenge.  good job.', '2003-07-11 18:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
