(354168, 28078, 6600, '<td valign="top">This is real cute!  Nicely done.  I like the the black space and the red color as well.  I like the amount of levels adjustment which creates the contrast.</td>', 'This is real cute!  Nicely done.  I like the the black space and the red color as well.  I like the amount of levels adjustment which creates the contrast.', '2003-07-11 20:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
