(354724, 28286, 5391, '<td valign="top">I think this is the best male nude of the challenge - a few tiny hot spots, and in the lower left there are some dark spots on the background that are a bit distracting.  A bit more play with the lighting and this would have been a 10.  I''m giving it an 8 as it is.  Nice pose and I like the symmetry.</td>', 'I think this is the best male nude of the challenge - a few tiny hot spots, and in the lower left there are some dark spots on the background that are a bit distracting.  A bit more play with the lighting and this would have been a 10.  I''m giving it an 8 as it is.  Nice pose and I like the symmetry.', '2003-07-12 16:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(354728, 27336, 5391, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this, the more I like it.  It''s the best use of the plastic wrap filter that I''ve ever seen.  So unusual.  The colors are fabulous.  The banana is a stroke of genius, and the way the sliced citrus fruits are reminicent of breasts turns this into art.  I originally rated this this a 6, but coming back and looking at it more closely, I''m judging it as "art" rather than straight photography, and I can see it on the wall of an art gallery...  I''m bumping my vote to a 10 and may buy a print if you make them available.</td>', 'The more I look at this, the more I like it.  It''s the best use of the plastic wrap filter that I''ve ever seen.  So unusual.  The colors are fabulous.  The banana is a stroke of genius, and the way the sliced citrus fruits are reminicent of breasts turns this into art.  I originally rated this this a 6, but coming back and looking at it more closely, I''m judging it as "art" rather than straight photography, and I can see it on the wall of an art gallery...  I''m bumping my vote to a 10 and may buy a print if you make them available.', '2003-07-12 16:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(354729, 28078, 5391, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, I really like the high contrast.  I normally don''t care much for this much use of a filter, but this image brings out such a feeling of intimacy that it gets a straight 8 from me.  Nice, creative work.</td>', 'Interesting composition, I really like the high contrast.  I normally don''t care much for this much use of a filter, but this image brings out such a feeling of intimacy that it gets a straight 8 from me.  Nice, creative work.', '2003-07-12 16:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(354731, 28121, 5391, '<td valign="top">Somewhat reminicent of a beautiful photo by one of my favorite photographers that can be seen here:  //www.photo.net/photodb/photo?photo_id=308079  I think that, perhaps, by playing with a more dynamic composition, this would be a 10.  Striking, well lit, and gracefully done.  7</td>', 'Somewhat reminicent of a beautiful photo by one of my favorite photographers that can be seen here:  //www.photo.net/photodb/photo?photo_id=308079  I think that, perhaps, by playing with a more dynamic composition, this would be a 10.  Striking, well lit, and gracefully done.  7', '2003-07-12 16:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
