(354780, 28005, 4007, '<td valign="top">Well, there are some hot spots here so I\''m going to have to take off a lot for that.<br/> <br/> <br/>Just kidding.  I really like the blown out technique of this shot.  The pose and framing are both excellent.  The hat adds enough character to keep it unqiue, but the lighting and exposure already provide uniqueness, so it just adds to the effect.  This is a shot that stands out.  Great work Dr.J. 10</td>', 'Well, there are some hot spots here so I\''m going to have to take off a lot for that.  Just kidding.  I really like the blown out technique of this shot.  The pose and framing are both excellent.  The hat adds enough character to keep it unqiue, but the lighting and exposure already provide uniqueness, so it just adds to the effect.  This is a shot that stands out.  Great work Dr.J. 10', '2003-07-12 18:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(354783, 28260, 7969, '<td valign="top">Nice line on the leg, water is interesting.  Shot is anything but boring, run of the mill.  Use of  unique model adds to the creativity of the shot.  Good B&amp;W tones.  One question/concern, Did the model want you to use her real name?</td>', 'Nice line on the leg, water is interesting.  Shot is anything but boring, run of the mill.  Use of  unique model adds to the creativity of the shot.  Good B&W tones.  One question/concern, Did the model want you to use her real name?', '2003-07-12 19:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(354785, 28283, 4767, '<td valign="top">Strong image, unusual pose, well done!</td>', 'Strong image, unusual pose, well done!', '2003-07-12 19:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(354788, 27976, 7969, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a change of genre within the challenge,  this is a GREAT baby shot!  The clean white rumpled sheets and the way the light hits them is remarkable.  The glimmer of light in the eyes reveal  the true innocence of a loved child.  They also convey an emotive quality which is most inviting.  Thanks for sharing such a gem of a shot.</td>', 'Nice to see a change of genre within the challenge,  this is a GREAT baby shot!  The clean white rumpled sheets and the way the light hits them is remarkable.  The glimmer of light in the eyes reveal  the true innocence of a loved child.  They also convey an emotive quality which is most inviting.  Thanks for sharing such a gem of a shot.', '2003-07-12 19:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(354791, 28078, 4767, '<td valign="top">a sensual action portrait, but I think of nudes as somewhat more... artistically srongly graphic.  It makes me smile to see the intimacy in the woman''s facial expression.</td>', 'a sensual action portrait, but I think of nudes as somewhat more... artistically srongly graphic.  It makes me smile to see the intimacy in the woman''s facial expression.', '2003-07-12 19:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
