(354797, 27719, 4767, '<td valign="top">wonderful interaction between the motther and child.  The warm lighting adds so much to that intimate moment.</td>', 'wonderful interaction between the motther and child.  The warm lighting adds so much to that intimate moment.', '2003-07-12 19:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
