INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(354865, 28193, 4007, '<td valign="top">Well done all around.  Nothing extraordinary or especially different/unique here, but a solid shot for sure.</td>', 'Well done all around.  Nothing extraordinary or especially different/unique here, but a solid shot for sure.', '2003-07-12 20:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(354868, 27841, 4007, '<td valign="top">very creative.  I now realize you added the tatoo in post production, but originally I was really impressed with how it lined up so perfectly over the two bodies.  Cool shot.</td>', 'very creative.  I now realize you added the tatoo in post production, but originally I was really impressed with how it lined up so perfectly over the two bodies.  Cool shot.', '2003-07-12 21:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(354870, 28220, 4007, '<td valign="top">If I wanted to be strict, this isn''t really nude, but it still goes together with the theme so I''ll leave it be.  This shot is simple and effective, although just a touch wider crop might have been nice, and I''m not really sure about the grainyness.  I think it''d have been better without it.</td>', 'If I wanted to be strict, this isn''t really nude, but it still goes together with the theme so I''ll leave it be.  This shot is simple and effective, although just a touch wider crop might have been nice, and I''m not really sure about the grainyness.  I think it''d have been better without it.', '2003-07-12 21:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(354873, 27563, 4007, '<td valign="top">I very much don''t like your subject here.  I really have no interest in seeing a kid peeing.  The photo itself is pretty straightforward and while it isn''t cluttered and the technical aspects seem fine, it doesn''t really have much to offer besides the subject, which as I said is completely unappealing to me.</td>', 'I very much don''t like your subject here.  I really have no interest in seeing a kid peeing.  The photo itself is pretty straightforward and while it isn''t cluttered and the technical aspects seem fine, it doesn''t really have much to offer besides the subject, which as I said is completely unappealing to me.', '2003-07-12 21:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(354875, 28288, 4007, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this shot seems off.  The bottom of the shot, where the detail is most interesting (hair, face, arms) is too dark, while the rest of the shot is rather light.  If the darkness were consistent throughout the shot it might work, but since most of it is lit, I find myself wishing that the lower part were much more visable.</td>', 'The lighting on this shot seems off.  The bottom of the shot, where the detail is most interesting (hair, face, arms) is too dark, while the rest of the shot is rather light.  If the darkness were consistent throughout the shot it might work, but since most of it is lit, I find myself wishing that the lower part were much more visable.', '2003-07-12 21:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(354878, 28192, 4007, '<td valign="top">The gold wrap seems out of place, like it has no reason to be on her body, and by colorizing it it becomes the central point of the photo, which is unfortunate.  The pose and other aspects are interesting and well done, but the gold item draws all attention to itself, and I think it really doesn''t work well for the shot.</td>', 'The gold wrap seems out of place, like it has no reason to be on her body, and by colorizing it it becomes the central point of the photo, which is unfortunate.  The pose and other aspects are interesting and well done, but the gold item draws all attention to itself, and I think it really doesn''t work well for the shot.', '2003-07-12 21:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(354882, 28052, 4007, '<td valign="top">This does not fit a nude challenge at all.</td>', 'This does not fit a nude challenge at all.', '2003-07-12 21:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(354885, 27532, 4007, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out what you''re going for here in a nude challenge (or just in general)</td>', 'I can''t figure out what you''re going for here in a nude challenge (or just in general)', '2003-07-12 21:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(354889, 28183, 4007, '<td valign="top">The shot has a very raw feel to me, which I think works for it.</td>', 'The shot has a very raw feel to me, which I think works for it.', '2003-07-12 21:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(354892, 27974, 4007, '<td valign="top">I really like how this shot turned out.  The diagonal line straight through and the stretched out pose work wonderfully.  The lighting is great.  The mask is a wonderful touch.  The result is playful, but also very alluring.  I''m sold. 10</td>', 'I really like how this shot turned out.  The diagonal line straight through and the stretched out pose work wonderfully.  The lighting is great.  The mask is a wonderful touch.  The result is playful, but also very alluring.  I''m sold. 10', '2003-07-12 21:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(354893, 28281, 4007, '<td valign="top">I can''t say I find the concept appealing at all.</td>', 'I can''t say I find the concept appealing at all.', '2003-07-12 21:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(354894, 28297, 4007, '<td valign="top">has a very artificial feel to it.</td>', 'has a very artificial feel to it.', '2003-07-12 21:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(354900, 27532, 806, '<td valign="top">An interesting exploration of abstract.</td>', 'An interesting exploration of abstract.', '2003-07-12 22:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(354903, 27976, 806, '<td valign="top">what a great expression! and you also succeeded in getting great catchlights in the eyes. This is a wonderful portrait, and the b&amp;w works well with it.</td>', 'what a great expression! and you also succeeded in getting great catchlights in the eyes. This is a wonderful portrait, and the b&w works well with it.', '2003-07-12 22:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(354904, 28121, 806, '<td valign="top">nice shadows and skin tones. I also like the grain effect. it is sort of a mirror image type of photo, but I don''t like the empty space in the middle, as it splits the image into 2 separate ones.. visually.<br/>not abundantly interesting to view for a prolonged period of time.<br/></td>', 'nice shadows and skin tones. I also like the grain effect. it is sort of a mirror image type of photo, but I don''t like the empty space in the middle, as it splits the image into 2 separate ones.. visually.not abundantly interesting to view for a prolonged period of time.', '2003-07-12 22:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(354906, 27589, 806, '<td valign="top">I just don''t like the art/filter effect you have used here. It makes it look less like a photograph. the composition is fine, and the sensuality is expressed well. I would have spent more time resolving the bikini line instead of adding a textured effect.</td>', 'I just don''t like the art/filter effect you have used here. It makes it look less like a photograph. the composition is fine, and the sensuality is expressed well. I would have spent more time resolving the bikini line instead of adding a textured effect.', '2003-07-12 22:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(354908, 28300, 806, '<td valign="top">the proximity of the lens to the subject together with the crop has given the legs and abdomen an unreal enlarged effect. It does not do the body justice. Also, the focus is off, and lighting flat, leaving this to be unappealing.</td>', 'the proximity of the lens to the subject together with the crop has given the legs and abdomen an unreal enlarged effect. It does not do the body justice. Also, the focus is off, and lighting flat, leaving this to be unappealing.', '2003-07-12 22:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(354911, 28298, 806, '<td valign="top">the definition of the body created by the light is very nice - although perhaps a diffuser would have helped some areas from being shiny. Loss of DOF on the hip (?) - top right - keeps my eye in the center of the photograph.. where as my eye would like to travel along the curve, but it halted and brought back to center again.</td>', 'the definition of the body created by the light is very nice - although perhaps a diffuser would have helped some areas from being shiny. Loss of DOF on the hip (?) - top right - keeps my eye in the center of the photograph.. where as my eye would like to travel along the curve, but it halted and brought back to center again.', '2003-07-12 22:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(354913, 28052, 806, '<td valign="top">good clear shot.. cute how the kitty is posed in the basket, and munching on a part of it! bet you''re getting hammered for putting a kitty in the nude challenge. <br/>I think it is a photograph that could sell well, and be used for many purposes though, so you should be proud of this achievement.</td>', 'good clear shot.. cute how the kitty is posed in the basket, and munching on a part of it! bet you''re getting hammered for putting a kitty in the nude challenge. I think it is a photograph that could sell well, and be used for many purposes though, so you should be proud of this achievement.', '2003-07-12 22:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(354947, 28011, 5391, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot a lot.  I think perhaps it could be improved by playing with different lighting - perhaps more diffused lighting from each side, so that you''d still see the textures of the legs, but you''d capture more detail.  As it is, I tend to squint at this, wanting it to be just a bit clearer, wanting the image to jump out at me a bit more.  I''m glad that someone took an image of a man''s legs, however.  The muscle structure of a man''s arms and legs are always amazing to me, as a female - strong, yet graceful lines.  7</td>', 'I really like this shot a lot.  I think perhaps it could be improved by playing with different lighting - perhaps more diffused lighting from each side, so that you''d still see the textures of the legs, but you''d capture more detail.  As it is, I tend to squint at this, wanting it to be just a bit clearer, wanting the image to jump out at me a bit more.  I''m glad that someone took an image of a man''s legs, however.  The muscle structure of a man''s arms and legs are always amazing to me, as a female - strong, yet graceful lines.  7', '2003-07-12 23:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(354949, 28222, 5391, '<td valign="top">The tones and lighting in this shot are just beautiful, as is your dof separating the model from the background.  Beautiful detail in her hair, and it''s nice to see a head attached to a body.  I''d love to see more from this session - this pose feels a bit uncomfortable to me, as if she''s a bit too tense while leaning back.  (I want to reach my hand out for her to lean on so she can relax.  Possibly something I''m reading into it that isn''t there - only a minor nit-pick.)  Other than that, you''ve got the tones down perfectly and the composition perfect, as well as a gorgeous model.</td>', 'The tones and lighting in this shot are just beautiful, as is your dof separating the model from the background.  Beautiful detail in her hair, and it''s nice to see a head attached to a body.  I''d love to see more from this session - this pose feels a bit uncomfortable to me, as if she''s a bit too tense while leaning back.  (I want to reach my hand out for her to lean on so she can relax.  Possibly something I''m reading into it that isn''t there - only a minor nit-pick.)  Other than that, you''ve got the tones down perfectly and the composition perfect, as well as a gorgeous model.', '2003-07-13 00:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(354951, 28192, 5391, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this, except for the colored earring...  Somehow, I personally find it distracting (perhaps it''s just me, I don''t find the colored garment distracting in any way...)  Lovely tones, great use of the blown-out white background.</td>', 'I love everything about this, except for the colored earring...  Somehow, I personally find it distracting (perhaps it''s just me, I don''t find the colored garment distracting in any way...)  Lovely tones, great use of the blown-out white background.', '2003-07-13 00:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(354955, 27336, 3724, '<td valign="top">sureal bath image..... the plasticized water is remarkable.  Love the way the fruit seems imbedded into the water....  and the added bannana on the soap dish!  A most interesting picture.</td>', 'sureal bath image..... the plasticized water is remarkable.  Love the way the fruit seems imbedded into the water....  and the added bannana on the soap dish!  A most interesting picture.', '2003-07-13 00:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(354964, 28290, 3724, '<td valign="top">gorgeous colour and soft focus...........  Like the unfinnished green and turquoise bead string...........   contrasting with the red.  Exquisite composition.   8</td>', 'gorgeous colour and soft focus...........  Like the unfinnished green and turquoise bead string...........   contrasting with the red.  Exquisite composition.   8', '2003-07-13 00:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(354974, 28192, 3724, '<td valign="top">Superior title.....   a state of awareness difficult to attain!     I imagine the model with her eyes closed..... sees the rapture.    I see a remarkable translucent metalic bronze coloured garment......   contrasting with the b and w  - fetus position of the attractive woman............  The white backgound is utilitarian, but appropriate.</td>', 'Superior title.....   a state of awareness difficult to attain!     I imagine the model with her eyes closed..... sees the rapture.    I see a remarkable translucent metalic bronze coloured garment......   contrasting with the b and w  - fetus position of the attractive woman............  The white backgound is utilitarian, but appropriate.', '2003-07-13 00:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(355002, 28227, 10045, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but I am not real fond of the placement of the left hand.</td>', 'Nice photo, but I am not real fond of the placement of the left hand.', '2003-07-13 02:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(355047, 28222, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo.  i love the composition and tones.  well done.</td>', 'beautiful photo.  i love the composition and tones.  well done.', '2003-07-13 03:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(355055, 27790, 9232, '<td valign="top">Composition <br/>This composition is masterfully selected, cropped and presented for this challenge.  I think that the image has too much whitespace in the bottom right side but it is inevitable as both the in focus left hand and the lines of the thigh are necessary components to this creation.  The hands and hair being in focus provide a different interpretation of feminie nudity that almost forces a fresh perspective on the viewer by obfuscating the breasts and pubic area with the shower door.  This image has a subtle undertone of lines contrasted against the otherwise blurred body of the model.  For this reason the straight lines of the fingers, arms and thighs are important to this presentation but the lines shown in the hair yield the best contrast as they are in the largest focal point, amid the deepest colored section and show some of the longest straight edges in the composition.<br/> <br/>Color<br/>After copying this image into Photoshop and trying it in grayscale, I believe color is the best presentation format for this image as the depth of hues in the model''s hair give multidimensional aspect to the focii that are most in-focus.  The proximity of the colors in this image present another problem if its moved into grayscale; white balance becomes an issue.  The absence of any color other than the model''s natural colors and the light colored background help the viewer focus on the subject.<br/> <br/>Lighting<br/>Lighting is the one place where this picture might have a few problems for me.  The diffusion caused by the intervening medium (shower door) yield a stronger power to the clear or white light especially at the top of the image where the light overpowers part of the model''s head and causes the hands to washout of focus if put into grayscale (once again, why this color presentation works for me).  I would like to see a variation of this image where the light source is redirected to a lower spot behind the model or where the light is diffused a little more at the top of the image.<br/> <br/>Focus<br/>The focus is fine in this photo; the hands (which are the least blurred by the shower door due to their immediate proximity with that medium) are in reasonable focus given the composition.  I could stand to see the model''s body a little closer to the intervening medium to bring it more into focus but I understand the artist''s interpretation.<br/> <br/>Overall<br/>This image works for me and I feel that it is a fresh presentation of a nude, feminine form because of the focal point that the hands and hair lend to the image.</td>', 'Composition This composition is masterfully selected, cropped and presented for this challenge.  I think that the image has too much whitespace in the bottom right side but it is inevitable as both the in focus left hand and the lines of the thigh are necessary components to this creation.  The hands and hair being in focus provide a different interpretation of feminie nudity that almost forces a fresh perspective on the viewer by obfuscating the breasts and pubic area with the shower door.  This image has a subtle undertone of lines contrasted against the otherwise blurred body of the model.  For this reason the straight lines of the fingers, arms and thighs are important to this presentation but the lines shown in the hair yield the best contrast as they are in the largest focal point, amid the deepest colored section and show some of the longest straight edges in the composition. ColorAfter copying this image into Photoshop and trying it in grayscale, I believe color is the best presentation format for this image as the depth of hues in the model''s hair give multidimensional aspect to the focii that are most in-focus.  The proximity of the colors in this image present another problem if its moved into grayscale; white balance becomes an issue.  The absence of any color other than the model''s natural colors and the light colored background help the viewer focus on the subject. LightingLighting is the one place where this picture might have a few problems for me.  The diffusion caused by the intervening medium (shower door) yield a stronger power to the clear or white light especially at the top of the image where the light overpowers part of the model''s head and causes the hands to washout of focus if put into grayscale (once again, why this color presentation works for me).  I would like to see a variation of this image where the light source is redirected to a lower spot behind the model or where the light is diffused a little more at the top of the image. FocusThe focus is fine in this photo; the hands (which are the least blurred by the shower door due to their immediate proximity with that medium) are in reasonable focus given the composition.  I could stand to see the model''s body a little closer to the intervening medium to bring it more into focus but I understand the artist''s interpretation. OverallThis image works for me and I feel that it is a fresh presentation of a nude, feminine form because of the focal point that the hands and hair lend to the image.', '2003-07-13 04:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(355061, 28229, 4767, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, and perhaps more a portrait than a nude.  Yes, it reveals something of the subject, but more an attitude or lifestyle than just how light falls on body parts.  It has... a certain je ne sais quoi, revelaton and mystery together.</td>', 'Very interesting, and perhaps more a portrait than a nude.  Yes, it reveals something of the subject, but more an attitude or lifestyle than just how light falls on body parts.  It has... a certain je ne sais quoi, revelaton and mystery together.', '2003-07-13 05:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
