(355185, 28058, 806, '<td valign="top">jeez.. I looked like this more at 6 months! either this model is carrying small, or is not 9 months along! LOL<br/>Anyway.. back to photography..<br/>I think the pose is not as dramatic as it could be. It is more documentary than expressive. I think maternity portraits should be more expressive. The lighting is beautifully done, and the soft focus - though a bit too soft - is a good choice too.<br/> <br/></td>', 'jeez.. I looked like this more at 6 months! either this model is carrying small, or is not 9 months along! LOLAnyway.. back to photography..I think the pose is not as dramatic as it could be. It is more documentary than expressive. I think maternity portraits should be more expressive. The lighting is beautifully done, and the soft focus - though a bit too soft - is a good choice too. ', '2003-07-13 12:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(355186, 28274, 806, '<td valign="top">terrific use of light. the b&amp;w treatment of this .. or maybe the over use of curves or similar ... has made this person look plastic. I like the effect because it leaves the viewer to wonder. I may have tried to crop a bit more off the top of the frame.</td>', 'terrific use of light. the b&w treatment of this .. or maybe the over use of curves or similar ... has made this person look plastic. I like the effect because it leaves the viewer to wonder. I may have tried to crop a bit more off the top of the frame.', '2003-07-13 12:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(355189, 27897, 806, '<td valign="top">this is a high key representation - I am not sure yet if that works here.<br/>The central subject is the nipple, with the curved shadow leading the eye to it because of the high key. This keeps the viewer''s eye completely centered in the photo. Therefore, I think this may have had a greater impact if you had rotated the photo slightly clockwise, so that the curve shadow begins slightly from the lower left, leading the eye to the nipple which would then be closer to the upper right corner, and the abundant white space would then also form more interesting shapes.</td>', 'this is a high key representation - I am not sure yet if that works here.The central subject is the nipple, with the curved shadow leading the eye to it because of the high key. This keeps the viewer''s eye completely centered in the photo. Therefore, I think this may have had a greater impact if you had rotated the photo slightly clockwise, so that the curve shadow begins slightly from the lower left, leading the eye to the nipple which would then be closer to the upper right corner, and the abundant white space would then also form more interesting shapes.', '2003-07-13 12:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(355236, 28192, 2764, '<td valign="top">Oooh - karen - i think you have a winner here!!! Best one I''ve seen yet!  The gold on the skarf is jst perfect!</td>', 'Oooh - karen - i think you have a winner here!!! Best one I''ve seen yet!  The gold on the skarf is jst perfect!', '2003-07-13 15:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(355248, 27571, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the nipple peeking out seems rather unnatural, particularly with the white fringe tucked in underneth it.  If the breast were out of the outfit a little bit farther perhaps the fringe could remain out and still provide the amount of exposure you were going for.  Of course I''m not sure how well that would work in real life, but in theory I think the more natural looking shot would help a lot.  I like this a lot either way though.  Good work.</td>', 'I like the composition, but the nipple peeking out seems rather unnatural, particularly with the white fringe tucked in underneth it.  If the breast were out of the outfit a little bit farther perhaps the fringe could remain out and still provide the amount of exposure you were going for.  Of course I''m not sure how well that would work in real life, but in theory I think the more natural looking shot would help a lot.  I like this a lot either way though.  Good work.', '2003-07-13 16:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(355250, 28283, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like how the framing was done.  The pose is nice and the shot turned out well. If the feet were symetrical it might have helped, especially since the frame draws attention to them. Nice work.</td>', 'I like how the framing was done.  The pose is nice and the shot turned out well. If the feet were symetrical it might have helped, especially since the frame draws attention to them. Nice work.', '2003-07-13 16:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
