(355255, 27666, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''m not particularly interested in commenting on models, but in this case, that arm is so hairy that it becomes a problem.  The tones of the shot are consistent except the arm is much darker, therefore it draws attention to itself and away from the better parts of this shot.  Aside from that, I like the concept and the crop on this shot.</td>', 'I''m not particularly interested in commenting on models, but in this case, that arm is so hairy that it becomes a problem.  The tones of the shot are consistent except the arm is much darker, therefore it draws attention to itself and away from the better parts of this shot.  Aside from that, I like the concept and the crop on this shot.', '2003-07-13 16:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(355256, 28078, 4007, '<td valign="top">This shot is wonderful and disappointing at the same time.  There are definately things I like about it, first and foremost is probably the look on her face.  It''s perfectly expressive.  I also really like having the couple at the bottom of the frame with the negative space above them.   The specific pose, with her on top and enough showing to see that she''s entirely nude, works great as well.  The problem for me is the filter you applied.  I would really like to see this shot without the filter (perhaps you''ll upload it after the challenge?) because so much detail is lost here.  I do somewhat like the artistic effect, but I think perhaps if the filter were faded to 25-50% of what it is now it would be better.  Good luck.</td>', 'This shot is wonderful and disappointing at the same time.  There are definately things I like about it, first and foremost is probably the look on her face.  It''s perfectly expressive.  I also really like having the couple at the bottom of the frame with the negative space above them.   The specific pose, with her on top and enough showing to see that she''s entirely nude, works great as well.  The problem for me is the filter you applied.  I would really like to see this shot without the filter (perhaps you''ll upload it after the challenge?) because so much detail is lost here.  I do somewhat like the artistic effect, but I think perhaps if the filter were faded to 25-50% of what it is now it would be better.  Good luck.', '2003-07-13 16:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(355258, 28191, 4007, '<td valign="top">Seems like more digital art than photography, but I like the shapes and tones throughout the shot, and the result is very nice.  Good work.</td>', 'Seems like more digital art than photography, but I like the shapes and tones throughout the shot, and the result is very nice.  Good work.', '2003-07-13 16:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
