(355404, 28283, 4967, '<td valign="top">This looks a lot like one of the photos I have on my favorites list <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=16735" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Spooky</a> by joebar.  Very nicely done!  I love the feet coming out of the frame... I''m guessing she was on a chair?  I''m not sure someone could stand that way... but maybe.  I love your black background and your lighting...very symmetrical and nicely done image.  The only thing that somewhat bothers me about this photo, is the fact that all of your sides of your frame are equal except for the top one... not sure why you chose to do that?  It bothers me quite a bit, and it detracts me from the photo, unfortunately I have to drop a point off for it... but it''s still a 9 :-)  Nice job!</td>', 'This looks a lot like one of the photos I have on my favorites list Spooky by joebar.  Very nicely done!  I love the feet coming out of the frame... I''m guessing she was on a chair?  I''m not sure someone could stand that way... but maybe.  I love your black background and your lighting...very symmetrical and nicely done image.  The only thing that somewhat bothers me about this photo, is the fact that all of your sides of your frame are equal except for the top one... not sure why you chose to do that?  It bothers me quite a bit, and it detracts me from the photo, unfortunately I have to drop a point off for it... but it''s still a 9 :-)  Nice job!', '2003-07-13 22:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(355412, 27583, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is very nicely done... nice lighting... I like the graininess of the photo... almost looks like you or whoever''s nice looking torso this is, was covered in sand.  Interesting what you chose to do with this.  Good luck! -8-</td>', 'This is very nicely done... nice lighting... I like the graininess of the photo... almost looks like you or whoever''s nice looking torso this is, was covered in sand.  Interesting what you chose to do with this.  Good luck! -8-', '2003-07-13 22:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(355413, 28290, 4967, '<td valign="top">Definently a dreamy look to this.  Not something I would pick for "nude" but I guess it works technically.  I like the softness of this... it really makes it look unreal and dreamy.  I''m not sure why you choose to use the patterned background... but I''m not sure I care for it.  -6-</td>', 'Definently a dreamy look to this.  Not something I would pick for "nude" but I guess it works technically.  I like the softness of this... it really makes it look unreal and dreamy.  I''m not sure why you choose to use the patterned background... but I''m not sure I care for it.  -6-', '2003-07-13 22:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(355415, 28282, 4967, '<td valign="top">LOVE the perspective on this shot... very nicely done... also great stop action... I''m guessing you did it with a flash to get it at a high shutter speed.  Is he wearing swim trunks... or is it just my imagination?  hehehe... the light on the face is somewhat harsh, especially on the nose and chin, but I''m not sure how that could have been avoided.  Interesting and different take on the challenge.  -7-</td>', 'LOVE the perspective on this shot... very nicely done... also great stop action... I''m guessing you did it with a flash to get it at a high shutter speed.  Is he wearing swim trunks... or is it just my imagination?  hehehe... the light on the face is somewhat harsh, especially on the nose and chin, but I''m not sure how that could have been avoided.  Interesting and different take on the challenge.  -7-', '2003-07-13 22:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
