(355639, 28193, 2612, '<td valign="top">I like it... The smile and facial expression are great. I don\''t know if it was intentional, but the highlights on the feet seem to lead my eyes from head to foot so I get the feeling of one entirely comfortable and content person. The diagonal on the left supports her head and shoulders, but the buttons seem a little too dominate relative to the rest of the photo (only thing I could find as a possible recommendation for improvement). I\''ll sure I\''ll keep looking back at this one.</td>', 'I like it... The smile and facial expression are great. I don\''t know if it was intentional, but the highlights on the feet seem to lead my eyes from head to foot so I get the feeling of one entirely comfortable and content person. The diagonal on the left supports her head and shoulders, but the buttons seem a little too dominate relative to the rest of the photo (only thing I could find as a possible recommendation for improvement). I\''ll sure I\''ll keep looking back at this one.', '2003-07-14 02:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
