(357752, 27532, 7033, '<td valign="top">Incredible....It''s a flower. You deserve first place. Great idea.</td>', 'Incredible....It''s a flower. You deserve first place. Great idea.', '2003-07-16 03:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(357783, 28248, 6388, '<td valign="top">Very, very good.  Great use of the free-edit rule, and a very powerful image.  the lighting is bang-on as well.  can''t find much wrong with it.  What did it look like with the colour reflection? (I KNOW you tried it!)</td>', 'Very, very good.  Great use of the free-edit rule, and a very powerful image.  the lighting is bang-on as well.  can''t find much wrong with it.  What did it look like with the colour reflection? (I KNOW you tried it!)', '2003-07-16 03:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(358107, 28227, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is almost really good.  I don''t like the pose of the right leg at all.  The rest of it is very good.</td>', 'This is almost really good.  I don''t like the pose of the right leg at all.  The rest of it is very good.', '2003-07-16 08:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(358110, 27336, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the surrealist take on this but I think you should''ve went with a little more.  I''m thinking more like both breasts and possibly a face, masked if need be.  I think a little too much is cut off.  Idea is intense.  The banana at the top gives it the Dali quality to me.  Nice work</td>', 'I like the surrealist take on this but I think you should''ve went with a little more.  I''m thinking more like both breasts and possibly a face, masked if need be.  I think a little too much is cut off.  Idea is intense.  The banana at the top gives it the Dali quality to me.  Nice work', '2003-07-16 08:12:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(358121, 27583, 3540, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the graininess of it.  I think you should''ve went with something besides head on.  Now if this were a chick, that''s a whole different story :)</td>', 'Don''t like the graininess of it.  I think you should''ve went with something besides head on.  Now if this were a chick, that''s a whole different story :)', '2003-07-16 08:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(358131, 27974, 3540, '<td valign="top">Mask idea is great.  A little mystery.  Don''t like what she''s doing with her arms.  I think you might be cheating her on a cup size when she''s stretched out like this.  Exposure is a little strange.  Seems a bit too bright in the upper left and the model is maybe a little underexposed on her left side.  Overall good picture quality and a good idea.  Shorten the pose and make her a little bigger in the frame and I''d be apt to score it higher.7</td>', 'Mask idea is great.  A little mystery.  Don''t like what she''s doing with her arms.  I think you might be cheating her on a cup size when she''s stretched out like this.  Exposure is a little strange.  Seems a bit too bright in the upper left and the model is maybe a little underexposed on her left side.  Overall good picture quality and a good idea.  Shorten the pose and make her a little bigger in the frame and I''d be apt to score it higher.7', '2003-07-16 08:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(358134, 27979, 3540, '<td valign="top">Wrinkly backdrops suck.   Good concept for a pic.  Like the heels and cuffs, good combo.  just a little too soft for my tastes.  Lighting is too flat.  You could add a little mystery and drama with some alternative lighting.</td>', 'Wrinkly backdrops suck.   Good concept for a pic.  Like the heels and cuffs, good combo.  just a little too soft for my tastes.  Lighting is too flat.  You could add a little mystery and drama with some alternative lighting.', '2003-07-16 08:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(358137, 28078, 3540, '<td valign="top">Playful, intimate, fun.  Not sold on the post shot effects, but concept of the picture is good.  Maybe my wife will "pose" like this for me.  Seriously, of the couple shots this one is by far the best :)  I like this picture, you did a good job with it.</td>', 'Playful, intimate, fun.  Not sold on the post shot effects, but concept of the picture is good.  Maybe my wife will "pose" like this for me.  Seriously, of the couple shots this one is by far the best :)  I like this picture, you did a good job with it.', '2003-07-16 08:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(358143, 28297, 3540, '<td valign="top">The angle of this picture is not flattering your model at all.  The pose is cheating her a cup size or so.  Outstretched arms above or behind don''t flatter, they flatten.  If she was going to stretch out her arms, do it forward.  It also can make a sort of divider between boobs and stomach which can make her look bigger.  That''s what I think anyway.  Good luck</td>', 'The angle of this picture is not flattering your model at all.  The pose is cheating her a cup size or so.  Outstretched arms above or behind don''t flatter, they flatten.  If she was going to stretch out her arms, do it forward.  It also can make a sort of divider between boobs and stomach which can make her look bigger.  That''s what I think anyway.  Good luck', '2003-07-16 08:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(358150, 27589, 3540, '<td valign="top">Looks like a really great model.  If she doesn''t want to show her face, I think ditching the panties would have made this much more sensuos, even if very little of the good downstairs got shown.  But I think it would''ve been better to show just a hint.  The panties unfortunately disrupt the continuity of her body line, which is very well portrayed by you.  The effect on it I cannot stand.  I''d have taken this regular and put a little dreamy effects on it or some other diffusion type effect.  A good piece of work with the actual picture taking.  post process is disappointing.</td>', 'Looks like a really great model.  If she doesn''t want to show her face, I think ditching the panties would have made this much more sensuos, even if very little of the good downstairs got shown.  But I think it would''ve been better to show just a hint.  The panties unfortunately disrupt the continuity of her body line, which is very well portrayed by you.  The effect on it I cannot stand.  I''d have taken this regular and put a little dreamy effects on it or some other diffusion type effect.  A good piece of work with the actual picture taking.  post process is disappointing.', '2003-07-16 08:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(358156, 28283, 3540, '<td valign="top">Like the border effect.  The concept of this pic is not portraying shy to me at all.   I''m not particularly fond of this photo for this challenge.</td>', 'Like the border effect.  The concept of this pic is not portraying shy to me at all.   I''m not particularly fond of this photo for this challenge.', '2003-07-16 08:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(358164, 28005, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good pose and form.  A classic style nude done very well.  I might have adjusted the pose to make the area between the models navel and nether regions not quite so wrinkly.  She OBVIOUSLY isn''t fat one bit and that just looks a little weird to me.  One of my top 2 for this challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'Good pose and form.  A classic style nude done very well.  I might have adjusted the pose to make the area between the models navel and nether regions not quite so wrinkly.  She OBVIOUSLY isn''t fat one bit and that just looks a little weird to me.  One of my top 2 for this challenge.  Good luck.', '2003-07-16 08:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(358190, 28286, 5728, '<td valign="top">The tattoo looks awfully familiar :-) Good pose, very original. The lighting is also very enhancing. The only bothersome part are the little spots in the lower left hand area.</td>', 'The tattoo looks awfully familiar :-) Good pose, very original. The lighting is also very enhancing. The only bothersome part are the little spots in the lower left hand area.', '2003-07-16 09:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(358242, 27974, 6458, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is choice. The soft tones of her skin and the subtle greys, blues, and whites go together nicely. Composition is excellent, I love that you have her in such a straight line on the diagonal. Almost like she''s seperating the dark from the light. Brilliant!</td>', 'The lighting here is choice. The soft tones of her skin and the subtle greys, blues, and whites go together nicely. Composition is excellent, I love that you have her in such a straight line on the diagonal. Almost like she''s seperating the dark from the light. Brilliant!', '2003-07-16 09:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(358398, 27841, 9262, '<td valign="top">very creative. one of my favorites :)</td>', 'very creative. one of my favorites :)', '2003-07-16 11:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(358403, 28248, 9262, '<td valign="top">i love this whole shot. i can''t say anything bad about it!</td>', 'i love this whole shot. i can''t say anything bad about it!', '2003-07-16 11:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(358406, 28297, 9262, '<td valign="top">Very creatively done, i suspect some rotation in this one :) one of my favorites.</td>', 'Very creatively done, i suspect some rotation in this one :) one of my favorites.', '2003-07-16 11:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(358408, 27775, 9262, '<td valign="top">This cracks me up! A very creative &amp; humourous take on the challenge. It makes me laugh every time I see it. Well Done!</td>', 'This cracks me up! A very creative & humourous take on the challenge. It makes me laugh every time I see it. Well Done!', '2003-07-16 11:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(358413, 27974, 9262, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites from the start. The mask is very mysterious and there is definitely a dreamlike quality.</td>', 'This was one of my favorites from the start. The mask is very mysterious and there is definitely a dreamlike quality.', '2003-07-16 11:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(358420, 27589, 9262, '<td valign="top">i really like this image. i think the lighting is super and the graininess is great. it reminds me of vintage nudes. great job. i happen to like your border. I usually don''t like borders at all :)</td>', 'i really like this image. i think the lighting is super and the graininess is great. it reminds me of vintage nudes. great job. i happen to like your border. I usually don''t like borders at all :)', '2003-07-16 11:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(358424, 28193, 9262, '<td valign="top">Your model is very beuatiful :) This shot reminds me of a modern take of the very curvaceous women who used to be in vogue in the oil paintings.</td>', 'Your model is very beuatiful :) This shot reminds me of a modern take of the very curvaceous women who used to be in vogue in the oil paintings.', '2003-07-16 11:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(358426, 27790, 9262, '<td valign="top">This one creeps me out! Well done :)</td>', 'This one creeps me out! Well done :)', '2003-07-16 11:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(358429, 27897, 9262, '<td valign="top">This is very simple, but very effective. I really like this one.</td>', 'This is very simple, but very effective. I really like this one.', '2003-07-16 11:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(358434, 28227, 9262, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like your models pose. It looks like she is scratching her bum which is not very attractive! Great lighting &amp; composition and focus though.</td>', 'I don''t really like your models pose. It looks like she is scratching her bum which is not very attractive! Great lighting & composition and focus though.', '2003-07-16 11:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(358436, 28058, 9262, '<td valign="top">this is a very beautiful pregnancy portrait. i love the soft focus and the lighting is excellent.</td>', 'this is a very beautiful pregnancy portrait. i love the soft focus and the lighting is excellent.', '2003-07-16 11:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(358442, 28290, 9262, '<td valign="top">i think the colors in this image are it''s strongest point. the contrasting colors of your background with the beads is great. the soft focus is great too, but the beads hanging down from your fingers are very blurry, more so than the rest of the shot and distracts the eye</td>', 'i think the colors in this image are it''s strongest point. the contrasting colors of your background with the beads is great. the soft focus is great too, but the beads hanging down from your fingers are very blurry, more so than the rest of the shot and distracts the eye', '2003-07-16 11:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(358826, 28005, 6405, '<td valign="top">Very soft 10 from me!<br/></td>', 'Very soft 10 from me!', '2003-07-16 14:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(358874, 28290, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful, as you well know!  The sof focus is lovley the colors are enticing, the beads make wonderful lines for the eye to follow, the curve of the instep is sensual. The purple roses are a bit hard to make out, they look like psychedelic swirls and compete with the subject just a bit. I hope this gets a ribbon!!!!</td>', 'This is wonderful, as you well know!  The sof focus is lovley the colors are enticing, the beads make wonderful lines for the eye to follow, the curve of the instep is sensual. The purple roses are a bit hard to make out, they look like psychedelic swirls and compete with the subject just a bit. I hope this gets a ribbon!!!!', '2003-07-16 15:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(358893, 28223, 2764, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Am I voting on the photo or the tattoo?  Tattoo gets a ten, Photo an 8,  The lighting is maybe stark, the ink on the tattoo too dark.  Nice negative space shapes.  The best shape of all ths the V of white skin in the middle of the tattoo.  I like that vulnerable white neck space contrasted with the harsh new tattoo/pain. the wisp of hair is nice too and the backs of the ears, maybe the arm competes with it because the arm seems strong?  8</td>', 'Hmmm. Am I voting on the photo or the tattoo?  Tattoo gets a ten, Photo an 8,  The lighting is maybe stark, the ink on the tattoo too dark.  Nice negative space shapes.  The best shape of all ths the V of white skin in the middle of the tattoo.  I like that vulnerable white neck space contrasted with the harsh new tattoo/pain. the wisp of hair is nice too and the backs of the ears, maybe the arm competes with it because the arm seems strong?  8', '2003-07-16 15:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(358894, 27589, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is lovely.  I love the grainness everywhere except on her leg which looks like a skin disease.  Everything else is beuatiful, the composition is wonderful, your attention to detail is perfect, like on the earring and the lace shpe between her breasts.  lighting is exquisite, Colors are perfect.  Frame could be better. I hope this gets a ribbon! 9</td>', 'This is lovely.  I love the grainness everywhere except on her leg which looks like a skin disease.  Everything else is beuatiful, the composition is wonderful, your attention to detail is perfect, like on the earring and the lace shpe between her breasts.  lighting is exquisite, Colors are perfect.  Frame could be better. I hope this gets a ribbon! 9', '2003-07-16 15:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(358896, 27583, 2764, '<td valign="top">I like everything here but the straight on composition.  The light, colors, soft focus are all wonderfull but posing him like that makes the picture boring and worse, I keep seeing a happy face with his nipples the eyes with dark shadows, the bellybutton the mouth and the lines of his stomach a smile with dimples. ...Or did you mean it to be a face?</td>', 'I like everything here but the straight on composition.  The light, colors, soft focus are all wonderfull but posing him like that makes the picture boring and worse, I keep seeing a happy face with his nipples the eyes with dark shadows, the bellybutton the mouth and the lines of his stomach a smile with dimples. ...Or did you mean it to be a face?', '2003-07-16 15:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(358898, 27979, 2764, '<td valign="top">A great idea which could have been better.  First fix the wrinkly sheet, then pose those terrific boots better.  Take a black marker and make her tattoo really black so it stands ot more.  Get another light to kill the shadow by her leg an arm.  I really like this and I think you should play with it some more.  it is soooo close to being a stunning photo - 6</td>', 'A great idea which could have been better.  First fix the wrinkly sheet, then pose those terrific boots better.  Take a black marker and make her tattoo really black so it stands ot more.  Get another light to kill the shadow by her leg an arm.  I really like this and I think you should play with it some more.  it is soooo close to being a stunning photo - 6', '2003-07-16 15:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(358902, 28077, 2764, '<td valign="top">ugh - I hate the yellow nai polish, focus is tooo soft, feet are too dark and black and blue.  Okay, now start over.  This is a ggod concept. the composition is more interesting than many, the interplay of negative and ositive space is interesting.  With that much black space I think maybe this would be much improved by changing to black and white,  The color doesn''t add, the shapes are the strong point.  B+W would make the sapes more abstract.</td>', 'ugh - I hate the yellow nai polish, focus is tooo soft, feet are too dark and black and blue.  Okay, now start over.  This is a ggod concept. the composition is more interesting than many, the interplay of negative and ositive space is interesting.  With that much black space I think maybe this would be much improved by changing to black and white,  The color doesn''t add, the shapes are the strong point.  B+W would make the sapes more abstract.', '2003-07-16 15:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(358945, 28287, 7086, '<td valign="top">Nice idea with the limited range of colours but the light, presumably the sun, is too harsh and fine detail has been lost because of this. It might be worth trying a similar shot earlier or later in the day.</td>', 'Nice idea with the limited range of colours but the light, presumably the sun, is too harsh and fine detail has been lost because of this. It might be worth trying a similar shot earlier or later in the day.', '2003-07-16 16:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(358951, 28090, 7086, '<td valign="top">Nice diffused lighting, good DOF, but nude...?</td>', 'Nice diffused lighting, good DOF, but nude...?', '2003-07-16 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(358956, 28086, 7086, '<td valign="top">If the lighting had been stronger and more directional I think this would have worked well as a duotone.</td>', 'If the lighting had been stronger and more directional I think this would have worked well as a duotone.', '2003-07-16 16:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(358960, 28052, 7086, '<td valign="top">A very good image with excellent lighting, if it had been in a different challenge you would score well with the "isn''t it sweet brigade". Unfortunately it doesn''t work for me in this challenge.</td>', 'A very good image with excellent lighting, if it had been in a different challenge you would score well with the "isn''t it sweet brigade". Unfortunately it doesn''t work for me in this challenge.', '2003-07-16 16:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(358967, 28077, 7086, '<td valign="top">Out of focus. I''m afraid I can''t stretch my imagination to see how this fits in the nude challenge, if the nails were "nude" not painted at least there would be a tenuous link.</td>', 'Out of focus. I''m afraid I can''t stretch my imagination to see how this fits in the nude challenge, if the nails were "nude" not painted at least there would be a tenuous link.', '2003-07-16 16:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(358980, 28300, 7086, '<td valign="top">If it was in sepia it would have a slight link with the title. I hope you were attempting to achieve a soft focus style, unfortunately it appears to be out of focus. The top would have been better cropped slightly lower to lose the highlight top-right.</td>', 'If it was in sepia it would have a slight link with the title. I hope you were attempting to achieve a soft focus style, unfortunately it appears to be out of focus. The top would have been better cropped slightly lower to lose the highlight top-right.', '2003-07-16 16:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(358989, 28254, 7086, '<td valign="top">Needs cropping slightly off the right to remove the lighter bar IMO</td>', 'Needs cropping slightly off the right to remove the lighter bar IMO', '2003-07-16 16:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(359001, 28281, 7086, '<td valign="top">Lighting is unbalanced enough show but not enough to indicate it was intentional, may work better as a portrait by cropping the arms off.</td>', 'Lighting is unbalanced enough show but not enough to indicate it was intentional, may work better as a portrait by cropping the arms off.', '2003-07-16 16:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(359005, 27841, 7086, '<td valign="top">Very, very good image, in my top 3. Slightly overlit on the left side of the image.</td>', 'Very, very good image, in my top 3. Slightly overlit on the left side of the image.', '2003-07-16 16:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(359010, 28248, 7086, '<td valign="top">In my top 3 for this challenge. Very good use of colour and very well composed (rule of thirds is hade to be broken). Personally I would have attempted to blend the images slightly, the hard edge on the right of the image distracts slightly (but I''m being very picky at this point!)</td>', 'In my top 3 for this challenge. Very good use of colour and very well composed (rule of thirds is hade to be broken). Personally I would have attempted to blend the images slightly, the hard edge on the right of the image distracts slightly (but I''m being very picky at this point!)', '2003-07-16 16:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(359012, 28192, 7086, '<td valign="top">Very good use of light and colour (or lack of it). In my top 3 for this challenge. Personally I wouldn''t have used the frame and the background is too stark and looks unnatural.</td>', 'Very good use of light and colour (or lack of it). In my top 3 for this challenge. Personally I wouldn''t have used the frame and the background is too stark and looks unnatural.', '2003-07-16 16:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(359018, 28286, 7086, '<td valign="top">A very striking image. Personally I find the background too bright on the left - it''s caused the left wrist and forearm  to be over-exposed. There also appears to be spots on the lens or background in the lower third of the left side.</td>', 'A very striking image. Personally I find the background too bright on the left - it''s caused the left wrist and forearm  to be over-exposed. There also appears to be spots on the lens or background in the lower third of the left side.', '2003-07-16 16:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(359027, 28283, 7086, '<td valign="top">Great lighing and composition. One of the few cases where a frame is used well - it give the picture a further dimension, the model is being viewed either from above or the front.</td>', 'Great lighing and composition. One of the few cases where a frame is used well - it give the picture a further dimension, the model is being viewed either from above or the front.', '2003-07-16 17:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(359040, 28260, 4007, '<td valign="top">I realize you are going for a stylistic extreme here, but I don''t like the result.  I don''t know why she''s wearing sunglasses or those things around the bottom of her legs.  They don''t seem to fit into the shot very well.  The lighting is harsh, and it doesn''t seem to create an interesting effect.  The framing here is wide, and doesn''t seem to function well either.  I''m sure all the things I''ve pointed out you were already aware of and intended to be as they are, so I suppose this won''t be very helpful, but at least you know why I didn''t like the shot.</td>', 'I realize you are going for a stylistic extreme here, but I don''t like the result.  I don''t know why she''s wearing sunglasses or those things around the bottom of her legs.  They don''t seem to fit into the shot very well.  The lighting is harsh, and it doesn''t seem to create an interesting effect.  The framing here is wide, and doesn''t seem to function well either.  I''m sure all the things I''ve pointed out you were already aware of and intended to be as they are, so I suppose this won''t be very helpful, but at least you know why I didn''t like the shot.', '2003-07-16 17:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(359087, 27571, 5585, '<td valign="top">nice...and subtle....</td>', 'nice...and subtle....', '2003-07-16 17:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(359177, 28286, 6458, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.. this looks familiar. I think I know who the subject (and thus the photographer) is.  I really like the light down the right side of his torso, but I would have liked to see a bit more lighting to highlight the shape of his back.</td>', 'Hmmm.. this looks familiar. I think I know who the subject (and thus the photographer) is.  I really like the light down the right side of his torso, but I would have liked to see a bit more lighting to highlight the shape of his back.', '2003-07-16 18:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(359180, 27559, 6458, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but this is an unflattering pose. Technically the photograph is well done, but that''s not enough to make up for the pose.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but this is an unflattering pose. Technically the photograph is well done, but that''s not enough to make up for the pose.', '2003-07-16 18:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(359187, 28288, 6458, '<td valign="top">I really like the combinations of textures and tones in this picture. I think they compliment eachother nicely. The white crumpled bedspread against the smooth darkness of her flesh works very well. good job.</td>', 'I really like the combinations of textures and tones in this picture. I think they compliment eachother nicely. The white crumpled bedspread against the smooth darkness of her flesh works very well. good job.', '2003-07-16 19:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(359188, 27719, 7969, '<td valign="top">I thought I had commented on this photo, but then I was trying to determine some icons and realized must not of gone through (if has can you let me know) wondering what doing wrong.  <br/>I really like the natural look, feel, light and expressions of this photo, you really have captured the loving bond between mom and baby.  The feeling is relaxed and overjoyed on baby and moms part.  Excellent capture.</td>', 'I thought I had commented on this photo, but then I was trying to determine some icons and realized must not of gone through (if has can you let me know) wondering what doing wrong.  I really like the natural look, feel, light and expressions of this photo, you really have captured the loving bond between mom and baby.  The feeling is relaxed and overjoyed on baby and moms part.  Excellent capture.', '2003-07-16 19:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(359189, 28248, 7969, '<td valign="top">Mostly I am curious how you did this shot, i.e. color with b&amp;w.  Hopefully you will tell us after the show.  Color and lighting are subtle and inviting.</td>', 'Mostly I am curious how you did this shot, i.e. color with b&w.  Hopefully you will tell us after the show.  Color and lighting are subtle and inviting.', '2003-07-16 19:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(359193, 28193, 7969, '<td valign="top">I think you chose a great subject, great to see natural looking folks in the challenge.  I think I would of like to have seen it with whole couch, though admittedly, probably wouldn''t of worked at this sort of angle.   nice job</td>', 'I think you chose a great subject, great to see natural looking folks in the challenge.  I think I would of like to have seen it with whole couch, though admittedly, probably wouldn''t of worked at this sort of angle.   nice job', '2003-07-16 19:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(359196, 28287, 6458, '<td valign="top">I think I knew who took this picture, but I''m not sure why. Shutterfly?  <br/>I''m sure you''ve heard this from bunches of people, but I''m not sure I''d consider this nude. It is a nice photo tho, and you''ve done a good job with the desaturation. Seeing as mine is not really a "nude" either, I''m giving you the benefit of the doubt. -7</td>', 'I think I knew who took this picture, but I''m not sure why. Shutterfly?  I''m sure you''ve heard this from bunches of people, but I''m not sure I''d consider this nude. It is a nice photo tho, and you''ve done a good job with the desaturation. Seeing as mine is not really a "nude" either, I''m giving you the benefit of the doubt. -7', '2003-07-16 19:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(359252, 28116, 7733, '<td valign="top">very nice shot for hair!!!</td>', 'very nice shot for hair!!!', '2003-07-16 20:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(359256, 28274, 7733, '<td valign="top">very realistic image, and interesting shadows</td>', 'very realistic image, and interesting shadows', '2003-07-16 20:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(359257, 27790, 7733, '<td valign="top">the "Shining" replicated.</td>', 'the "Shining" replicated.', '2003-07-16 20:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(359302, 28074, 4007, '<td valign="top">Thsi shot turned out very well.  I suppose it''d have been nice if the line in the concrete weren''t there, but that was probably beyond your control.  This definately embodies the idea of your title well.  The footprints leading up to the subject are perfect, and I like the postprocessing you''ve done on this shot.  It really makes the kid''s body stand out from the background with a sort of subtle glow.  The crisp shadow is a nice touch as well.  It might have been fun to experiment with different crops with the kid partway out of the frame or perhaps overlapping into a boarder, but I''ve got no complaints about thei crop.  Great work.</td>', 'Thsi shot turned out very well.  I suppose it''d have been nice if the line in the concrete weren''t there, but that was probably beyond your control.  This definately embodies the idea of your title well.  The footprints leading up to the subject are perfect, and I like the postprocessing you''ve done on this shot.  It really makes the kid''s body stand out from the background with a sort of subtle glow.  The crisp shadow is a nice touch as well.  It might have been fun to experiment with different crops with the kid partway out of the frame or perhaps overlapping into a boarder, but I''ve got no complaints about thei crop.  Great work.', '2003-07-16 20:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(359306, 28223, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like the composition a lot on this shot.  The crop seems just tight enough and the points of interest (tatto, head, hand) are in good places.  The hair adds interesting character to this shot as well, with the one strand hanging down and both light and dark strands showing.  Originally I really didn''t like the grain and the harsh contrast on this shot, and now I''m not so sure.  It looks like this was overexposed enough to lose detail on the skin, and then darkened, (although that''s just a guess) resulting in areas of the skin that are neither blown out or very detailed, which comes out kind of drab.  So I guess my main wish here is some more detail on the skin, or else a high key look all around, but I don''t have as much of an issue with those things as I originally did.  Great work.</td>', 'I like the composition a lot on this shot.  The crop seems just tight enough and the points of interest (tatto, head, hand) are in good places.  The hair adds interesting character to this shot as well, with the one strand hanging down and both light and dark strands showing.  Originally I really didn''t like the grain and the harsh contrast on this shot, and now I''m not so sure.  It looks like this was overexposed enough to lose detail on the skin, and then darkened, (although that''s just a guess) resulting in areas of the skin that are neither blown out or very detailed, which comes out kind of drab.  So I guess my main wish here is some more detail on the skin, or else a high key look all around, but I don''t have as much of an issue with those things as I originally did.  Great work.', '2003-07-16 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(359308, 27336, 4007, '<td valign="top">what a bizarre look this has to it.  I think it''s a bit overdone, but the idea isn''t bad at all.  Using the bananna to add depth to the shot was a good call, but it''d have been nice if it came through a bit clearer (perhaps better lit).</td>', 'what a bizarre look this has to it.  I think it''s a bit overdone, but the idea isn''t bad at all.  Using the bananna to add depth to the shot was a good call, but it''d have been nice if it came through a bit clearer (perhaps better lit).', '2003-07-16 20:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(359313, 27875, 4007, '<td valign="top">I enjoy abstract shots and I like this one.  I think it might have been interesting to have the hair in a sharper focus or to have more dramatic lighting on it, but it is effective as it is as well.  The crop is great and I love the flow of the hair.  The tone you chose works very well as well.</td>', 'I enjoy abstract shots and I like this one.  I think it might have been interesting to have the hair in a sharper focus or to have more dramatic lighting on it, but it is effective as it is as well.  The crop is great and I love the flow of the hair.  The tone you chose works very well as well.', '2003-07-16 20:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(359378, 28227, 10300, '<td valign="top">Best use of grayscale I''ve seen in a long time.  Great control of shadow and subject.</td>', 'Best use of grayscale I''ve seen in a long time.  Great control of shadow and subject.', '2003-07-16 22:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(359395, 28074, 6521, '<td valign="top">Veeeeery cool photo...</td>', 'Veeeeery cool photo...', '2003-07-16 22:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(359412, 28005, 472, '<td valign="top">i object to the blowout -- i think you could have preserved the tones and gradations in the flesh without overlighting it.  Also, if you have editing, you could have reduced the tummy wrinkles with perhaps a little bit of guassian blur.  Nitpicks aside, beautiful model and great composition.</td>', 'i object to the blowout -- i think you could have preserved the tones and gradations in the flesh without overlighting it.  Also, if you have editing, you could have reduced the tummy wrinkles with perhaps a little bit of guassian blur.  Nitpicks aside, beautiful model and great composition.', '2003-07-16 23:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(359495, 27897, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here, but the composition on this shot doesn''t work very well for me.  I''m not sure how I''d suggest to improve it, since I''d probably just suggest trying a lot of different things and seeing what works (which you probably already did).  I guess the one thing I think might improve it would be more separation of the breast from the rest of the body.  Just thoughts.</td>', 'I like the concept here, but the composition on this shot doesn''t work very well for me.  I''m not sure how I''d suggest to improve it, since I''d probably just suggest trying a lot of different things and seeing what works (which you probably already did).  I guess the one thing I think might improve it would be more separation of the breast from the rest of the body.  Just thoughts.', '2003-07-17 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(359507, 28219, 4007, '<td valign="top">The scar draws attention to itself, but I don''t get the impression that it''s supposed to be an important part of the shot.  The item at the bottom right is distracting as well and some better lighting might have made this more interesting.  I like the idea for the shot though, and I think the crop works well.</td>', 'The scar draws attention to itself, but I don''t get the impression that it''s supposed to be an important part of the shot.  The item at the bottom right is distracting as well and some better lighting might have made this more interesting.  I like the idea for the shot though, and I think the crop works well.', '2003-07-17 00:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(359510, 27571, 10040, '<td valign="top">A perfect 10........I mean the photo ;)  The lighting, the colors, the contrast are just perfect.  Oh, and she''s not bad either.</td>', 'A perfect 10........I mean the photo ;)  The lighting, the colors, the contrast are just perfect.  Oh, and she''s not bad either.', '2003-07-17 00:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(359511, 28086, 4007, '<td valign="top">it''s not as interesting as a real human figure.. and the image quality seems rather low here, but I like how the tones flow into the background.</td>', 'it''s not as interesting as a real human figure.. and the image quality seems rather low here, but I like how the tones flow into the background.', '2003-07-17 00:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(359514, 28005, 10040, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  My only criticism is that I wish it was a little darker.</td>', 'Great shot!  My only criticism is that I wish it was a little darker.', '2003-07-17 00:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(359523, 28283, 7339, '<td valign="top">Ok this is my favorite photo this week. I love the symmetry of her shoulders and legs. The title says shy and having her hide her face and using her hair to hide her other unmentionables in this way complements the title perfectly. I love the sharpness of the photo and the ingenuous way of having her feet come out of the frame, which also complements the overall picture. I wish I took photos like this, perfect lighting, perfect focus,  blah blah blah, I could go on all day. Well done a true blue ribbon!  10  <br/> <br/>Oh please make this available as a print I would love to have one.<br/></td>', 'Ok this is my favorite photo this week. I love the symmetry of her shoulders and legs. The title says shy and having her hide her face and using her hair to hide her other unmentionables in this way complements the title perfectly. I love the sharpness of the photo and the ingenuous way of having her feet come out of the frame, which also complements the overall picture. I wish I took photos like this, perfect lighting, perfect focus,  blah blah blah, I could go on all day. Well done a true blue ribbon!  10   Oh please make this available as a print I would love to have one.', '2003-07-17 01:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
