(360087, 28248, 3599, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting on this one.  Doing one half in color and the other in B&amp;W is an interesting twist that I like.  That said, I''m not sure if you were trying to mimic a real reflection or not.  If so I think you should have tried to get the hands to touch palms.  Either way I like the balance in the composition.  Good work and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really like the lighting on this one.  Doing one half in color and the other in B&W is an interesting twist that I like.  That said, I''m not sure if you were trying to mimic a real reflection or not.  If so I think you should have tried to get the hands to touch palms.  Either way I like the balance in the composition.  Good work and good luck in the challenge.', '2003-07-17 19:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(360089, 28183, 3599, '<td valign="top">I find the lighting a bit harsh.  And I don''t particulary like the fact that the models hair blends in and disappears into the background.  Still a nice effort.  Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I find the lighting a bit harsh.  And I don''t particulary like the fact that the models hair blends in and disappears into the background.  Still a nice effort.  Best of luck in the challenge.', '2003-07-17 19:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
