(361292, 28193, 6458, '<td valign="top">Greets from the Critique Club:<br/> <br/>Hi SharQ,<br/> <br/>This is a really good nude. Everything is well lit and your contrast is very good. Technically, I think it is excellent. <br/> <br/>I like the emotional and compositional side as well. Your model is sitting forward, engaging the camera and showing the world she is not afraid and is comfortable with her body.<br/> <br/>The only annoyances are the missing toe mentioned by one of your commenters (not really a big deal), and the small triangle of light up in the top right hand corner. <br/> <br/>Just all around good job! Best of luck with you future entries!<br/>-Matt</td>', 'Greets from the Critique Club: Hi SharQ, This is a really good nude. Everything is well lit and your contrast is very good. Technically, I think it is excellent.  I like the emotional and compositional side as well. Your model is sitting forward, engaging the camera and showing the world she is not afraid and is comfortable with her body. The only annoyances are the missing toe mentioned by one of your commenters (not really a big deal), and the small triangle of light up in the top right hand corner.  Just all around good job! Best of luck with you future entries!-Matt', '2003-07-19 20:53:49.000000', NULL, 0),
