(363736, 28005, 9602, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe people commented on the folds at the base of her stomach, first off, I think that adds a touch of realism, that is missing from alot of pictures in magazines, and no real person could ever have a perfectly flat stomach at that bend, the folds show that she is a real person with an actual body that is being bent.  But I love the picture, I think the model is beautiful and that the the white on white really add to the over all look and softness.</td>', 'I can''t believe people commented on the folds at the base of her stomach, first off, I think that adds a touch of realism, that is missing from alot of pictures in magazines, and no real person could ever have a perfectly flat stomach at that bend, the folds show that she is a real person with an actual body that is being bent.  But I love the picture, I think the model is beautiful and that the the white on white really add to the over all look and softness.', '2003-07-22 17:05:53.000000', NULL, 0),
