(1108429, 28005, 31744, '<td valign="top">Bonjour, Dr. Jones! How do people know to call you Martin? Great photo of a lovely lady, and with a loving hand. New to this site, (2weeks) &amp; 15mos new to Digital Photography, after a lifetime of (great) 35mil... How did you accomplish that ''draped'' white background effect?.. And, what is a ribbon? Should send you a pic or two of mine..Don''t know how yet.. By the way, I am from Candiac, south of Montreal. Been in Alberta 24 years...Not sure how to get an answer, but will post this now... Keep it up, love your stories! Most educational ! Love your photos, those silhouettes are awesome!</td>', 'Bonjour, Dr. Jones! How do people know to call you Martin? Great photo of a lovely lady, and with a loving hand. New to this site, (2weeks) & 15mos new to Digital Photography, after a lifetime of (great) 35mil... How did you accomplish that ''draped'' white background effect?.. And, what is a ribbon? Should send you a pic or two of mine..Don''t know how yet.. By the way, I am from Candiac, south of Montreal. Been in Alberta 24 years...Not sure how to get an answer, but will post this now... Keep it up, love your stories! Most educational ! Love your photos, those silhouettes are awesome!', '2005-01-14 23:51:18.000000', NULL, 0),
