(1787550, 28005, 46070, '<td valign="top">Very well done! I only have 2 minor points - (1) the fingers on the right hand seem peculiarly arranged and out of place and (2) it looks like the model is putting too much body weight on her left arm which throws the left shoulder too high (and hardens the arm muscles somewhat). Very minor points and I love your photo! I would encourage you to do a whole high key theme, as well!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-16 11:55:59.</i></td>', 'Very well done! I only have 2 minor points - (1) the fingers on the right hand seem peculiarly arranged and out of place and (2) it looks like the model is putting too much body weight on her left arm which throws the left shoulder too high (and hardens the arm muscles somewhat). Very minor points and I love your photo! I would encourage you to do a whole high key theme, as well!', '2005-10-16 12:55:42.000000', '2005-10-16 12:55:59.000000', 0),
